    # sy "是否给夜神月喂药恢复健康？" nointeract
    sy "Should you give Light Yagami medicine to restore his health?" nointeract

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:71
translate english daily_feed_5c3b62cc:

    # "夜神月皱着眉把药吞了下去。"
    "Light Yagami frowned and swallowed the medicine."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:72
translate english daily_feed_28dacdcb:

    # "好好休息就会恢复健康吧。"
    "Get some rest and Light will be healthy again."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:73
translate english daily_feed_d7b2b897:

    # sy "健康值恢复30点。"
    sy "Restores 30 health points."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:78
translate english daily_feed_79b82db5:

    # "你不想做没有意义的事情，这是你的选择。"
    "You don't want to do meaningless things—that's your choice."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:95
translate english daily_feed_e6cca05c:

    # "月对拿着食物的L露出无奈的表情。"
    "Light gave L a resigned look as he held out food."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:96
translate english daily_feed_725b301f:

    # Y "我现在吃不下这么多。"
    Y "I can't eat this much right now."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:108
translate english daily_feed_e6cca05c_1:

    # "月对拿着食物的L露出无奈的表情。"
    "Light gave L a resigned look as he held out food."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:109
translate english daily_feed_725b301f_1:

    # Y "我现在吃不下这么多。"
    Y "I can't eat this much right now."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:123
translate english daily_feed_e6cca05c_2:

    # "月对拿着食物的L露出无奈的表情。"
    "Light gave L a resigned look as he held out food."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:124
translate english daily_feed_725b301f_2:

    # Y "我现在吃不下这么多。"
    Y "I can't eat this much right now."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:184
translate english food_h1_309c89fc:

    # "L端来了豪华寿司套餐。"
    "L brought in a luxurious sushi platter."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:184
translate english food_h1_fe99640d:

    # "新鲜的生鱼片上反射出油润的光泽，被摆成漂亮的花样放在寿司米上，旁边点缀以绿叶和淡雅的花朵，干冰的雾气萦绕而上。"
    "The glistening, oil-rich sashimi caught the light, artfully arranged in elegant patterns atop seasoned sushi rice.  Garnished with greens and delicate flowers, with dry ice mist swirling around it."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:184
translate english food_h1_9ef63729:

    # "寿司的种类也相当丰富，甜虾、扇贝、鱿鱼等普通的款式簇拥着中间的金枪鱼大腹，整整齐齐摆出了豪迈的气势。"
    "The variety was impressive. Sweet shrimp, scallops, squid, and other standard selections surrounded a centerpiece of fatty tuna belly. All neatly arranged, displaying a bold and grand demeanor."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:184
translate english food_h1_39293741:

    # "精致典雅的餐具被摆在单独的餐盘上，酱油和磨好的山葵酱装在小碟里，供食客随意取用。"
    "Elegant tableware was placed on a separate tray. With soy sauce and freshly grated wasabi in small dishes for the diner's convenience."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:184
translate english food_h1_12cce148:

    # "L从餐车上取下一个巨大的餐盘，摆在狭小的囚室地面上，瞬间变得让人无从下脚。"
    "L took a massive serving platter from the cart and set it on the cramped cell floor Instantly leaving no room to move."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:184
translate english food_h1_81057b4f:

    # "夜神月坐在硬板床上，看着满地的高级寿司沉默了几秒。"
    "Yagami Light sat on the hard bed. Staring at the spread of premium sushi in silence for a few seconds."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:199
translate english food_h1_972fb123:

    # Y smile2 "这是我的断头饭吗？"
    Y smile2 "Is this my last meal?"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:201
translate english food_h1_dc21e45b:

    # "夜神月讽刺地笑了。"
    "Yagami Light smirked sarcastically."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:203
translate english food_h1_866f7d08:

    # L "不用怀疑我的心意，请用吧，夜神君。"
    L "Don't doubt my sincerity. Please, enjoy, Yagami-kun."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:205
translate english food_h1_381e4995:

    # Y Light "龙崎，如果想看我的笑话，我劝你打消这个念头。我现在即使沦落至此，也不会求你做什么事情。"
    Y Light "Ryuzaki, if you're trying to mock me, give it up. Even in this state, I won't beg you for anything."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:207
translate english food_h1_0ac7a5bb:

    # "似乎是懒得和L讲更多的话，夜神月直接把眼睛闭了起来。"
    "As if unwilling to waste more words on L, Yagami Light simply closed his eyes."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:207
translate english food_h1_b507fc1a:

    # "这也无可厚非，因为他双手被铐住，而这狭窄囚室内连一张桌子也没有，"
    "It was understandable—his hands were cuffed, and the cramped cell didn't even have a table."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:207
translate english food_h1_ab520354:

    # "如果不是快要饿死，这高傲的青年是不可能像低等动物一样伏下身趴在地上进食的。"
    "Unless he was starving, this proud young man would never lower himself to eat like an animal on the floor."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:207
translate english food_h1_eea006a0:

    # "他的潜台词已经相当明确了：如果诚心请他用餐，就拿出相应的尊重来。"
    "His unspoken message was clear: If you truly want him to eat, show some respect."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:221
translate english food_h1_a074d06e:

    # L "夜神君，你似乎没有身为阶下囚的自觉。"
    L "Yagami-kun, you don't seem to grasp your position as a prisoner."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:223
translate english food_h1_c841f2b8:

    # "夜神月闭着眼一动不动。"
    "Yagami Light remained motionless, eyes shut."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:225
translate english food_h1_48a934ac:

    # Y "请回吧。记得把东西带走，如果要闻着腐烂的鱼腥味睡觉我也会很困扰的。"
    Y "Leave. And take this with you.I would also be very troubled if I had to sleep with the stench of rotting fish."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:227
translate english food_h1_5f6913b7:

    # "看来他是不会吃这些食物了，难得你准备了这么多。"
    "Seems he won't eat. A shame, after all your effort."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:229
translate english food_h1_022751ac:

    # "L收起餐盘，推着餐车离开了。"
    "L collected the dishes and wheeled the cart away."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:231
translate english food_h1_2b3d9208:

    # "饱食度无变化。"
    "    Satiety unchanged.​"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:242
translate english food_h1_602f190d:

    # "L摆弄了一下餐车，那辆银白色的餐车隔板展开，支柱升降，变成了一张简单的桌子。"
    "L adjusted the cart—its silver panels unfolded, its supports rose, transforming into a makeshift table."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:242
translate english food_h1_bb366479:

    # "L将餐盘从地上拿起，放到了这张临时桌子上。"
    "He lifted the platter from the floor and placed it on the temporary table."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:242
translate english food_h1_f78bac9f:

    # "随后，L取出一把细长的金属钥匙，打开了夜神月手上的镣铐，递给他一条热腾腾的白毛巾。"
    "Then, he took out a slender metal key Unlocked Yagami Light's handcuffs, and handed him a steaming white towel."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:252
translate english food_h1_dabe7944:

    # "L并不担心夜神月会逃走——他脚上的镣铐不解除，人就只能像僵尸一样蹦跳，并且极易失去平衡。"
    "L wasn't worried that Yagami Light would escape. With the ankle restraints still on, he could only hop like a zombie, easily losing balance."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:252
translate english food_h1_2f1ea4f1:

    # "夜神月沉默地接过毛巾擦手，动作优雅地开始用餐。"
    "Yagami Light silently accepted the towel, wiped his hands, and began eating with refined grace."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:252
translate english food_h1_a03519fe:

    # "他用餐的速度不疾不徐，目光沉静，双手平稳，没有丝毫颤抖。"
    "He ate at a steady pace, his gaze calm, his hands steady, without the slightest tremor."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:252
translate english food_h1_2ff12bfb:

    # "L见过太多在死前最后一餐饭时痛哭流涕者，大声咒骂者，绝望禁食者，暴饮暴食者……"
    "L had seen many reactions to last meals—weeping, cursing, fasting in despair, gorging in panic…"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:252
translate english food_h1_445b20e3:

    # "当然也有和夜神月一样以平常心用餐的，但是非常少。"
    "A few, like Yagami Light, ate with calm detachment—but they were rare."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:252
translate english food_h1_ead25c01:

    # "其中，{color=#ff0000}夜神月的罪行是最重的，杀过的人也是最多的{/color}。"
    "And among them, ​Yagami Light's crimes were the worst, his body count the highest.​"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:252
translate english food_h1_bfcc30ca:

    # "用餐时，两个人都没有说话，夜神月将L充满兴趣的视线视作空气，平静地吃完了这不知道有没有下一顿的餐食。"
    "Neither spoke during the meal.  Yagami Light ignored L's curious gaze, calmly finished this meal, not knowing if there would be another one."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:252
translate english food_h1_45018197:

    # "当他停筷时，剩余的料理还相当多。不过这也正常，为了观察对方的喜好，L拿了两人份的食物。"
    "When he set down his chopsticks, much remained.  Unsurprising, as L had brought enough for two to gauge each other's preferences."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:252
translate english food_h1_ff55bb9b:

    # "重新戴好手铐后，夜神月开口了。"
    "Once the cuffs were back on, Yagami Light spoke"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:271
translate english food_h1_86e9d1f9:

    # Y "谢谢招待。所以，你是有求于我吗？"
    Y "Thanks for the meal. So, you want something from me?"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:273
translate english food_h1_2c1b4578:

    # "夜神月的目光直视过来，非常锐利。"
    "His sharp gaze locked onto L."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:279
translate english food_h1_74421c6c:

    # L "我只是想招待夜神君吃一顿饭而已，没有额外的用意哦。"
    L "I just wanted to treat you, Yagami-kun. No ulterior motives."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:281
translate english food_h1_0d41c4c1:

    # "夜神月露出一个讥讽的笑容，似乎在嘲笑你的虚伪。"
    "Yagami Light gave a mocking smile, as if ridiculing Ryuzaki's hypocrisy."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:283
translate english food_h1_11c20bda:

    # Y smile2 "谢谢，请回吧。"
    Y smile2 "Thanks. Now leave."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:285
translate english food_h1_29aa204a:

    # "夜神月重新闭上了眼睛，做出逐客的姿态。"
    "Yagami Light closed his eyes again, making a gesture to dismiss the visitor."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:287
translate english food_h1_2bd0a96b:

    # "L收拾好餐盘，推着餐车离开了。"
    "L packed the dishes and wheeled the cart out."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:295
translate english food_h1_5cfe2b74:

    # L "我确实有些话想和夜神君聊聊。"
    L "There is something I'd like to discuss."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:297
translate english food_h1_39b6d477:

    # Y "事先声明，关于死亡笔记和死神的事情，我已经没有可以告诉你的了。"
    Y "Let me be clear—I have nothing left to say about the Death Note or Shinigami."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:299
translate english food_h1_8b1f7cb5:

    # L "我知道，我想和夜神君说的不是这个。"
    L "I know. This isn't about that."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:301
translate english food_h1_d43fc42f:

    # L order1 "夜神月，你不会死。"
    L order1 "Yagami Light… you won't die."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:302
translate english food_h1_53d868d6:

    # voice "voice/light/Y_chuan2.mp3"
    # Y fadai "什么？"
    voice "voice/light/Y_chuan2.mp3"
    Y fadai "What?"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:305
translate english food_h1_3971e1ae:

    # "夜神月眨了眨眼睛，第一时间没有听懂这句话的意思。"
    "Yagami Light blinked, uncomprehending for a moment."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:305
translate english food_h1_a0ad90bc:

    # "但是第二秒，巨大的荒谬感席卷而来。"
    "However, in the second, an overwhelming sense of absurdity swept over him."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:305
translate english food_h1_1706bd7a:

    # "这个公开宣言要把Kira送上死刑台的侦探，L，说自己不会死？"
    "L—the detective who vowed to send Kira to execution—was saying he wouldn't die?"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:305
translate english food_h1_4c011307:

    # "对公众怎么交代？法庭呢？公安部门呢？知道Kira真实身份和死神的所有人不会反对吗？他在干什么？他想干什么？"
    "What about the public? The courts? The police?  Everyone who knew Kira's identity and the Shinigami—wouldn't they object?  What is he doing? What does he want to do?"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:305
translate english food_h1_61b71b22:

    # "无数的疑问充满夜神月的大脑，让他一时间说不出话。"
    "Questions flooded Yagami Light's mind, leaving him speechless."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:305
translate english food_h1_65417ca5:

    # "数秒后，夜神月才艰涩地说出一个问句。"
    "After a pause, he forced out a strained reply."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:319
translate english food_h1_902f1dc7:

    # Y renzhen "你是什么意思，龙崎？"
    Y renzhen "What do you mean, Ryuzaki?"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:321
translate english food_h1_c563afc5:

    # L "就是字面意思，你不会被执行注射死刑，从此也没有社会上的身份，从此在这里活着。"
    L "Exactly that. No lethal injection, No legal identity. Just… living here."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:323
translate english food_h1_25a8f311:

    # "夜神月看着你的眼神像看着一个疯子。"
    "Yagami Light stared at him like he was insane."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:325
translate english food_h1_d2bb5ad3:

    # Y "这对你有什么好处？你想让我干什么？"
    Y "What's in it for you? What do you want from me?"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:327
translate english food_h1_398d1a94:

    # "L开始不自觉地啃着指甲。"
    "L began unconsciously biting his nails."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:329
translate english food_h1_6009d9b4:

    # L order2 "硬要说……只是一种直觉。"
    L order2 "If I must say… just a hunch."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:331
translate english food_h1_1a5e9650:

    # L order2 "夜神君死掉的话就太可惜了。仅此而已。"
    L order2 "It'd be a waste if Yagami-kun died. That's all."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:333
translate english food_h1_8c17c4b4:

    # Y Light "（就因为这么简单的理由？真是胆大包天的人。）"
    Y Light "(Over something so trivial? It truly takes great audacity.)"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:335
translate english food_h1_26cfd59b:

    # Y "不管怎样，这是你单方面做的事情。如果想以此要挟我做什么违背我意愿的事情，趁早死了心吧。"
    Y "Either way, this is your doing. If you intend to use this to blackmail me into doing something against my will, forget it."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:337
translate english food_h1_b39af1d3:

    # "夜神月的表情相当冷淡。"
    "Yagami Light's expression was quite cold."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:339
translate english food_h1_81b828a6:

    # "你也没想过夜神月会因此对你感激涕零，不过这才符合他的性格，不是吗？"
    "You hadn't expected gratitude—this defiance suited him, isn't it?"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:341
translate english food_h1_a154c88d:

    # L "没关系，夜神君，我们来日方长。"
    L "No matter. We have time, Yagami-kun."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:343
translate english food_h1_a0a44fb1:

    # "留下别有深意的一句话，L推着餐车离开了囚室。"
    "With that cryptic remark, L wheeled the cart out."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:358
translate english food_h2_91355188:

    # "L端着托盘走入了囚室，托盘上承着一只精巧的黑色漆盒，盒身边缘甚至嵌着精美的金丝。"
    "L carried a tray into the cell. On which rested an exquisite black lacquered box adorned with delicate gold filigree along its edges."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:358
translate english food_h2_34ee3220:

    # "打开盒盖后，浓郁的油脂气息扑面而来。"
    "When the lid was opened, a rich aroma of grilled fat wafted out."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:358
translate english food_h2_2541300c:

    # "两片浸润着酱汁的鳗鱼铺在颗粒饱满、晶润透亮的米饭上，鱼皮被炙烤到表面微焦边缘酥脆，再用筷子微微一划便能将软嫩的鱼肉完全分开。"
    "Two slices of eel, soaked in sauce, were laid on top of well-grained, shiny rice.  The fish skin was grilled until slightly charred at the surface and crispy at the edges.  With just a slight flick of the chopsticks, the tender fish meat could be completely separated."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:358
translate english food_h2_0e48b23f:

    # "焦香的酱汁顺着缝隙渗入米饭，托盘上甚至还贴心地摆着供人研磨的山葵和罐装的七味粉。"
    "The caramelized sauce seeped into the rice below through the crevices. And the tray even thoughtfully included wasabi (Japanese horseradish) for grinding and a small jar of shichimi togarashi (seven-spice powder). "

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:358
translate english food_h2_a5fcad96:

    # "月明显被食物的香气吸引了，他的目光看向L，头略微抬起。"
    "Light was obviously attracted by the aroma of the food. Light Lifted his gaze toward L, tilting his head slightly."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:371
translate english food_h2_921f6937:

    # Y "可以让我自己吃吗？"
    Y "Can I eat by myself?"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:379
translate english food_h2_fd8c0558:

    # "L似乎没有解开月手铐的意思，他抓起一旁放置的银勺，插入鳗鱼饭底部挖起一勺米饭送到了月的嘴边。"
    "L showed no intention of unlocking Light's handcuffs.  Instead, he picked up a silver spoon that was placed beside him. He scooped up a portion of the unagi don (grilled eel rice bowl) from the bottom, and brought it to Light's lips."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:379
translate english food_h2_abf0ff42:

    # "鱼肉因为L粗糙的举动散了开来，酥脆的鱼皮也被留在了盒内。"
    "The eel flaked apart from L's rough handling, leaving the crispy skin behind in the box."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:383
translate english food_h2_31120b2d:

    # L smile1 "今天特意准备了和食，夜神君请用吧。"
    L smile1 "I prepared Japanese cuisine specially for you today. Yagami-kun, Please enjoy."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:385
translate english food_h2_fc48440c:

    # "月没有接话，乖顺地吃掉了第一口。"
    "Light said nothing, obediently taking the first bite."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:385
translate english food_h2_6d3a6ebd:

    # "鳗鱼入口即化，微甜的酱汁回味浓香，配着上乘的大米味道属实不错。"
    "Its slightly sweet sauce leaving a deep, savory aftertaste that paired perfectly with the high-quality rice."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:385
translate english food_h2_a89e2e0b:

    # "第一口下肚后，月反复扫视了几眼漆盒里剩下的鱼皮，不断对L流露出“你真是暴殄天物”的眼神。"
    "After swallowing, Light repeatedly glanced at the remaining eel skin in the box. Shooting L a look that clearly said, You're wasting something precious."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:391
translate english food_h2_a3058d05:

    # L surprise "夜神君想吃鱼皮吗？"
    L surprise "Yagami-kun, do you want the skin?"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:393
translate english food_h2_9a160f9e:

    # Y "并没有，我已经很饿了，可以吃第二口吗？"
    Y "Not really. I'm just very hungry—may I have the next bite?"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:395
translate english food_h2_db09a151:

    # "L捧起装着盒子的鳗鱼饭，舀起第二口喂到月的嘴边。"
    "L lifted the box again, scooping up another spoonful and feeding it to Light."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:395
translate english food_h2_b56f033a:

    # "鱼皮带着韧性难以切断，所以L只是简单地把鳗鱼肉从鱼皮上刮了下来、和米饭拌在一起完成了一次的喂食。"
    "The skin, being chewy and hard to cut. So L simply scraped the eel meat off the skin and mixed it with rice to complete a feeding."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:395
translate english food_h2_61795c65:

    # "L注视着月咽下第二口，有些多余的酱汁沾到了床单上，在他拿出纸巾清理的时候，L注意到月的眼神还是不时停留在盒内的鳗鱼皮上。"
    "As Light swallowed, some excess sauce dripped onto the sheet. While L wiped it away with a tissue, he noticed Light's eyes still lingering on the untouched eel skin which remained inside the box."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:401
translate english food_h2_f18e996e:

    # L smile2 "果然，夜神君还是想吃的吧。"
    L smile2 "So, you do want it after all."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:403
translate english food_h2_fc025ef0:

    # Y "……"
    Y "……"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:405
translate english food_h2_dce5d791:

    # L smile1 "既然这样的话，不喂给夜神君反倒是我的不对了。"
    L smile1 "In that case, it would be my fault not to give it to you."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:407
translate english food_h2_4d16e40a:

    # "L暂时放下了盒子，将木质的一次性筷子掰开，用筷尖划开鱼肉、分开鱼皮切出完整的一小块鳗鱼，"
    "L set the box aside briefly, splitting a pair of disposable wooden chopsticks.  With precision, he sliced through the eel, separating a neat piece of skin along with the meat."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:407
translate english food_h2_5102b03a:

    # "又用勺子舀了满满一勺被酱汁浸润的米饭，把那块形状漂亮的鳗鱼放到米饭上，缓缓将勺子递到月嘴边。"
    "Then scooped up a spoonful of sauce-soaked rice. At last, he placed the perfectly cut eel on top before bringing it to Light's lips."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:411
translate english food_h2_2486ed56:

    # L "好了，这口是夜神君喜欢的样子了。"
    L "There. Now it's prepared just how Yagami-kun likes it."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:413
translate english food_h2_ca512ee5:

    # "月对L轻慢的措辞露出了愤怒的神情，他皱着眉怒视着L，如果不是有手铐的话、月一定会和监禁时期一样揍人吧？"
    "Light's expression twisted in anger at L's condescending tone.  He glared, brows furrowed. If not for the handcuffs, he might have lashed out as he had during his confinement."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:413
translate english food_h2_15180518:

    # "但是在饥饿感的驱使下，这种怒意只维持了几秒，月闭上眼，似乎是下定了很大的决心张开嘴，把勺子含入嘴中吃下了那口饭。"
    "However, under the drive of hunger, this anger lasted only for a few seconds.  Light closed his eyes, seemingly making a great resolve. He opened his mouth, and took the spoon into his mouth, eating that bite of food."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:413
translate english food_h2_c7c9c82e:

    # "和鱼肉绵软的口感不同，牙齿咬下后能轻易感受到鱼皮边缘的酥脆，多次咀嚼后炭火浓厚的香气便混着鳗鱼皮胶质满满的筋道口感一块充斥着口腔。"
    "Unlike the soft flesh, after biting down, the crisp edges of the skin gave way with a satisfying crunch.  With each chew, the rich aroma of charcoal fire mixes with the gelatinous texture of the eel skin, filling the mouth."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:413
translate english food_h2_61b1eabe:

    # "接下来就只是重复切割鱼肉、舀起米饭，组装一个“小型鳗鱼饭”，然后喂给月的重复过程。"
    "From then on, it was a cycle. L carefully cutting the eel, scooping rice, assembling a mini unagi don (grilled eel rice bowl), and feeding Light."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:413
translate english food_h2_6c2b8cf3:

    # "在盒子差不多见底的时候，月挪动了一下身子，重新和L拉开了一点距离。"
    "When the box was nearly empty, Light shifted slightly, putting distance between himself and L again."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:423
translate english food_h2_1a8cf9a3:

    # Y "我吃饱了。"
    Y "I'm full."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:425
translate english food_h2_eeefa350:

    # "L闻言停止了喂食的举动，将勺子和筷子放进已经空了的漆盒内，用湿巾简单擦试了一下月嘴边残留的酱汁，最后端着餐具离开了囚室。"
    "Upon hearing the words, L stopped feeding him, placing the spoon and chopsticks into the now-empty lacquered box.  After wiping a trace of sauce from Light's lips with a wet wipe, he carried the tray out of the cell."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:429
translate english food_h2_f28f074e:

    # "L把托盘放在一旁，用钥匙帮月解开了拷在背后的双手。"
    "Setting the tray aside, L unlocked the handcuffs binding Light's hands behind his back."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:429
translate english food_h2_0230dd2a:

    # "月活动了下因长时间束缚而有些酸痛的手腕，他抬眼看了看托盘上的食物，对L询问道。"
    "Light flexed his wrists, sore from prolonged restraint. Then glanced at the food on the tray and asked:"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:436
translate english food_h2_96b30bf3:

    # Y "今天是让我自己进食么？"
    Y "Am I allowed to eat by myself today?"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:437
translate english food_h2_351d80a0:

    # L smile1 "是的。感觉夜神君更想自己动手吃鳗鱼饭的样子。"
    L smile1 "Yes. I thought Yagami-kun might prefer handling the unagi don(grilled eel rice bowl) on his own."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:438
translate english food_h2_eebb2a76:

    # "L体贴地拿起托盘上承放的热毛巾，确认温度正好后递给了月。"
    "L considerately picked up a warm towel from the tray. He checked its temperature, and handed it to Light."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:439
translate english food_h2_5ea7636e:

    # L pt "请用。"
    L pt "Here."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:440
translate english food_h2_e041ed51:

    # Y "……谢谢。"
    Y "...Thanks."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:441
translate english food_h2_9f062bf6:

    # "月接过毛巾简单擦拭了一下面部和双手，随后托起漆盒底部、用筷子规整地分开鱼肉，稍稍用力划开鱼皮，将鱼皮和鱼肉连着米饭一同舀起送入了口腔。"
    "Light wiped his face and hands, then lifted the lacquered box.  Using the chopsticks, he neatly separated the eel. Slicing through the skin with slight pressure, he scooped up the fish skin, fish meat, and rice together and sent them into his mouth."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:441
translate english food_h2_c7c9c82e_1:

    # "和鱼肉绵软的口感不同，牙齿咬下后能轻易感受到鱼皮边缘的酥脆，多次咀嚼后炭火浓厚的香气便混着鳗鱼皮胶质满满的筋道口感一块充斥着口腔。"
    "Unlike the soft flesh, after biting down, the crisp edges of the skin gave way with a satisfying crunch.  With each chew, the rich aroma of charcoal fire mixes with the gelatinous texture of the eel skin, filling the mouth."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:447
translate english food_h2_d09470eb:

    # L smile1 "渡说这家鳗鱼饭在都内算热门店铺，我特意给夜神君预定了最好的套餐呢。"
    L smile1 "Watari mentioned this unagi restaurant is quite popular in Tokyo, I reserved their best set for you."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:448
translate english food_h2_e140efe7:

    # L "夜神君吃得还满意吗？"
    L "Are you enjoying it, Yagami-kun?"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:449
translate english food_h2_670f3436:

    # "坦白来说，这确实是月有生以来吃过最美味的一次鳗鱼饭。"
    "Truthfully, it was the most delicious unagi don (grilled eel rice bowl) Light had ever tasted."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:449
translate english food_h2_8001615b:

    # "不论是鱼肉回弹的质感还是恰到好处的酱汁调味，配上口感极佳的米饭绝对算得上美味佳肴。"
    "Whether the springy texture of the eel, or the perfectly balanced sauce, served with the exceptional rice made it an undeniable delicacy."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:449
translate english food_h2_820b133b:

    # "月回味着鳗鱼肉在口腔内残存的质感，拿起一旁的毛巾擦拭了一下沾到嘴边的酱汁。"
    "Light savored the lingering taste, dabbing sauce from the corner of his mouth with the towel."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:454
translate english food_h2_7feb83e1:

    # Y smile1 "能吃出来用了很好的食材，的确是很不错的一餐。"
    Y smile1 "I can tell high-quality ingredients were used. It's an excellent meal."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:455
translate english food_h2_d74b5953:

    # "L笑了，似乎是对月的回答很满意，他屈起膝盖蹲在床侧，歪着脑袋继续观察棕发青年的进食行为。"
    "L smiled, seemingly pleased with the answer.  He crouched by the bed, tilting his head as he continued observing the eating habits of the young man with brown hair."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:456
translate english food_h2_96445b23:

    # L smile1 "那真是太好了，夜神君请继续吧。"
    L smile1 "That's wonderful. Please, continue."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:459
translate english food_h2_fb87214e:

    # "美味的鳗鱼饭充分勾起了月的食欲，他很快舀起下一口放入口中，快速消灭起盒内的食物。"
    "The delicious meal had fully awakened Light's appetite. He quickly took another bite, devouring the contents of the box at a faster pace."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:459
translate english food_h2_2c561cdd:

    # "大约吃到一半时月停下了动作，转而将目光投向承放着山葵的研磨器。"
    "About halfway through, he paused, turning his attention to the grinder for wasabi (Japanese horseradish)."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:459
translate english food_h2_b476b158:

    # "他握住山葵的尾部，在研磨板上前后摩擦起来，随后用筷尖挑起一小撮淡绿色的山葵泥放在鳗鱼上，"
    "Grasping the wasabi root (Japanese horseradish), he grated it against the board. Then used his chopsticks to place a small mound of pale green wasabi paste onto the eel."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:459
translate english food_h2_90c30cfa:

    # "些微的辛辣感缓解了脂肪的油腻，更让人食欲大增、一筷子接一筷子地大快朵颐起来。"
    "The mild spiciness cut through the fatty richness. It enhanced the flavor and drove him to eat even more eagerly—bite after bite without pause."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:459
translate english food_h2_aff601c7:

    # "月很快吃完了这一餐，在完食后将餐具整齐地叠放在托盘上，重新向床铺内侧挪动了一点、拉开和L的距离。"
    "Soon, the meal was finished. Light neatly arranged the utensils on the tray. Then he shifted further toward the inner side of the bed, distancing himself from L again."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:469
translate english food_h2_1a8cf9a3_1:

    # Y "我吃饱了。"
    Y "I'm done."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:471
translate english food_h2_16b003f4:

    # "L闻言端起了托盘，将筷子和剩余的山葵放进已经空了的漆盒内，最后重新帮月拷好手铐、检查没有任何疏忽后端着托盘离开了囚室。"
    "L picked up the tray, placing the chopsticks and remaining wasabi (Japanese horseradish) into the empty lacquered box.  After re-cuffing Light's hands and ensuring no oversights, he carried the tray out of the cell."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:476
translate english food_h3_b0349067:

    # "L进入囚室时带着一辆三层的金属制推车，每一层都摆放着由两个不锈钢圆盖仔细罩住的银制托盘，从缝隙中隐隐传出烘焙的香气。"
    "L entered the room, carefully pushing a three-tiered metal trolley. Beneath those two cloches on each silver tray, a faint aroma of baking leaked and spread."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:476
translate english food_h3_aacc52d3:

    # "L将推车送到月的床铺前、缓缓打开第一层的两个圆盖："
    "Rolling the trolley in front of Light's bedside, L slowly uncovered the first set of cloches:"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:482
translate english food_h3_a3190830:

    # "左边是一只手掌大小的藤编筐，里面薄薄垫了层烘焙纸，承着外壳酥脆的圆面包和几片切好的法棍；"
    "On the left was a palm-sized wicker basket, thinly lined with baking paper, holding crispy round buns and a few slices of a baguette."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:482
translate english food_h3_e7b8bef6:

    # "右边摆放着一片柳叶形的瓷器，颜色各异的复合口味黄油呈橄榄形依次在位，瓷盘的最右边码放着一把雕工精美的银制黄油刀。"
    "On the right was a willow-leaf-shaped porcelain plate. Olive-shaped multi-coloured compound butters of complex flavors were arranged in quenelles. There was an exquisitely carved silver butter knife on the far right of the plate."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:482
translate english food_h3_2b308ba7:

    # "L将两个圆盖收好，展开餐巾铺到月的腿上，随后站在推车后面像个尽职尽责的侍者一样向月介绍起复合黄油的味道。"
    " L collected the first-layered cloches, spread a serviette over Light's lap. He then stood behind the cart like a dutiful server, introducing Light the flavors of butters."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:488
translate english food_h3_012c2728:

    # L smile1 "从左边开始分别是绿色的罗勒开心果黄油、棕色的咸味增黄油、以及混合了辣椒与龙虾膏的红色黄油。"
    L smile1 "Starting from the left were green basil and pistachio butter, brown salty miso butter, and red butter mixed with chili and lobster tomalley."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:488
translate english food_h3_58390a47:

    # L smile1 "不管哪一种都很适合搭配餐前面包，是经典的法餐开局呢。"
    L smile1 "Each of these is very suitable for the bread course, a classic French starter."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:497
translate english food_h3_b81f0047:

    # "L从面包筐中取出一只圆面包，随意撕下一角后用黄油刀抹上了绿色的开心果黄油递到月的嘴边。"
    "L took a bun from the bun basket, tore off a piece casually, spread it with the green pistachio butter with the butter knife, and brought it to Light's mouth."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:497
translate english food_h3_06ece022:

    # "月在咀嚼时吃到了罗勒独有的草本香气，和开心果油润的口感相性拔群，即使他有些讨厌L拿着面包喂食自己的行为，还是努力地将食物吞下了肚子。"
    "Chewing the bun, Light tasted the perfect fusion of the unique herbal aroma and the rich, oily texture of the pistachios. Even though he disliked being fed by L' s hand, he still managed to swallow it."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:497
translate english food_h3_89eeb971:

    # "在沾有黄油部分的面包全部吃完后，月很快停下了进食的动作。"
    "After finishing the buttered part of the bun, Light quickly stopped eating."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:503
translate english food_h3_58e1dc7c:

    # L surprise "怎么了月君，这些食物就够么？"
    L surprise "What's wrong, Yagami-kun? Is this enough?"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:504
translate english food_h3_944c7b23:

    # Y "……只吃面包太干了，我还想尝尝别的口味的黄油。"
    Y "...Just bun is too dry. I'd like to try the other butter flavors."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:505
translate english food_h3_f992cec2:

    # Y "而且刚刚吃的那个味道还蛮不错的，我想再来一点。"
    Y "And that I just had was quite good. Could I have a bit more?"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:507
translate english food_h3_5258c49a:

    # "月计算着面包剩余的数量，在心里谋划着应当如何享用这次的餐食。"
    "Light calculated the remaining number of buns, planning how to enjoy this meal."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:507
translate english food_h3_271e7f10:

    # "今天L送来的餐点质量很高，现在还只是餐前面包、而餐车足足堆满了三层。"
    "The quality of the food L brought today was remarkably high, and this was just the bun course—all the three tiers of the trolley were filled by cloches."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:507
translate english food_h3_ae4cd295:

    # "从餐车堆放的碗碟推算，恐怕所有菜肴的数量加起来都不亚于一顿正式的西餐。"
    "Judging by the number of cloches, the total number of dishes appeared no less than that of a formal Western meal."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:513
translate english food_h3_e7df9dc4:

    # L smile3 "我知道了，月君请用吧。"
    L smile3 "I see. Please carry on, Yagami-kun."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:515
translate english food_h3_4c399535:

    # "L用餐刀重新为面包补上了一点黄油喂给月，而后撕下第二块面包，在月咀嚼完食物的时候恰到好处地将下一口递到月的嘴边。"
    " L spread some butter to the bun and fed it to Light, followed by a second piece of the bun, and perfectly timed the next bite to Light's lips the moment Light finished the food in mouth."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:515
translate english food_h3_491319ed:

    # "第二款棕色的黄油入口还带着些许甜味，月很快吃到了味增的酱香，红糖很好勾勒出黄油丰盈的口感，熟悉的家乡风味让月甚至怀念过往母亲为家人做的简餐。"
    "Light could taste the savory umami flavor soon after the sweet entry of the bun with the second, brown butter. The rich, creamy texture of the butter stood out well against Okinawan kokuto (brown sugar). The familiar taste of home cooking even reminded Light of those simple dishes that his mother used to make for her family."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:519
translate english food_h3_d772dade:

    # Y smile1 "很好吃呢。可以帮我再抹一点黄油吗？"
    Y smile1 "It's rather delicious. Could you please spread more butter for me?"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:521
translate english food_h3_07e1f60c:

    # "L惊讶于月的坦诚，一时间停下了手中的动作。"
    "L was surprised by Light's honesty and paused his actions for a while. "

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:521
translate english food_h3_1e1aed16:

    # "他和夜神月的对话很少没有硝烟味，狭小的囚室总会催生月的负面情绪，让月回呛他的每一句话。"
    "They seldom enjoyed the luxury of a peaceful conversation, because the cramped room always fueled Light's emotions, making him snap at L's every word."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:521
translate english food_h3_e8393ee9:

    # "但L将月难得的妥协归功于餐品的美味，并乐得靠喂食的行动缓和下自己和月之间的气氛———毕竟没有人会和食物过不去不是么。"
    " But L attributed Light's rare compromise to the delicious food and was glad to ease their atmosphere by feeding—after all, no one would refuse good food."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:521
translate english food_h3_e03cead6:

    # "在第二块黄油消灭殆尽后，L在面包的截面涂上了混有龙虾膏的辣味黄油，月浅尝了一口后便摇着头拒绝了L递来的下一块面包。"
    "After Light finished the second portion of butter, L spread the spicy butter mixed with lobster tomalley on the torn surface of the bun. Light took a small bite but then refused the next piece L offered, with his head shaking."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:529
translate english food_h3_ef4d1e40:

    # Y han "……太辣了，吃不了。"
    Y han "...Too spicy. Thank you."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:530
translate english food_h3_53288ef1:

    # L order2 "是这样啊，看来夜神君不擅长应对辣椒呢。"
    L order2 "That's it? Seems that Yagami-kun isn't good at chillies."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:532
translate english food_h3_949853d8:

    # "L一边回话一边揭开了下一层的圆盖，月瞧见两只碟碗，"
    "L replied when uncovering the next set of cloches. Light saw two bowls: "

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:532
translate english food_h3_52867d61:

    # "一碗盛着由应季蔬果、白煮蛋和些许面包干拌好的小份沙拉，一碗则是清澈见底、能闻到些许香气的法式清汤。"
    "One held a small salad tossed with seasonal fruits and vegetables, boiled egg, and some croutons. The other held a clear consommé from which a slight aroma wafted."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:540
translate english food_h3_ebc022c2:

    # "L绕到月的身后解开了他的手铐，将由另一条餐巾包裹着的刀叉递给月、并对月做出了请用的手势。"
    "L walked behind Light and unlocked his handcuffs. He handed Light the knife and fork wrapped in another serviette and gestured for him to eat."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:542
translate english food_h3_ee143b30:

    # L smile3 "今天的餐点更适合交给夜神君自己进食呢，请用吧。"
    L smile3 "Today's meal is more suitable for Yagami-kun to eat by yourself. Please, enjoy at your pleasure."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:544
translate english food_h3_13f152ba:

    # "青年早已被面包的香气吸引，虽然他很在意L一直盯着自己的眼睛———但月还是相当迫不及待地从筐里取出了那只圆面包。"
    "The young man had already been attracted by the aroma of the buns. Although he minded L's continuously watching him, Light still jumped at the chance to take the bun from the basket with his own hands."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:544
translate english food_h3_8e432d03:

    # "带着酥脆外壳的面包在掰开后露出内里细密柔软的气孔，月将面包分成四块，"
    "The bun, with its crisp crust, revealed fine, soft pores inside when broken apart. Light divided the bun into four pieces."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:544
translate english food_h3_f509f9f4:

    # "第一口没有选择搭配任何黄油，面包最为原始的麦香和咸味在口中扩散开来，直到月咽下后仍然留有浅淡的香气。"
    "For the first bite, he chose to simply taste it. The most primal wheat aroma and saltiness overcame his taste buds, long-lasting after he swallowed."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:544
translate english food_h3_8ed3cfc9:

    # "第二口月选择给面包抹上绿色的黄油，咀嚼时罗勒清新的草本味道混合着开心果浓厚的坚果香味充盈着鼻腔，油润的口感让月不禁撕下了更多的面包送入口中。"
    "For the second bite, Light chose to spread the green butter on the bun. As he chewed, the fresh herbal taste of basil mixed with the rich nutty aroma of pistachios filled his nasal cavity. The oily, rich texture made him unconsciously tear off more bun to eat."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:544
translate english food_h3_706a277f:

    # "第三口是日本相当传统的味增口味，但添加的些许红糖更增加了黄油的层次感，"
    "The third bite was a fairly traditional Japanese miso flavor, but the added brown sugar further enhanced the butter's complexity."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:544
translate english food_h3_cbbb57b6:

    # "月偏爱这款黄油熟悉的家乡味道，甚至挪用了部分属于第三种黄油的面包份额用来配餐，直至黄油被刮了个精光。"
    "Light favoured the familiar hometown taste of this butter and even used part of the bun originally meant for the third butter, until the miso butter was scraped clean."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:544
translate english food_h3_0e616647:

    # "月似乎不擅长应付最后一款黄油的辣味，青年只是浅浅尝了味道后便没有再挖取新的一口，"
    "Light seemed unable to handle the spiciness of the last butter. The young man just took a small taste and didn't scoop another part."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:544
translate english food_h3_626f1d74:

    # "而是将黄油刀放回瓷盘、拿起腿上放置的餐巾擦了擦嘴，相当乖顺地等待L为他揭开托盘第二层的秘密。"
    "Instead, he placed the butter knife back on the porcelain plate, picked up the serviette on his lap to wipe his mouth, and waited quite obediently for L to reveal the secret of the second tier."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:560
translate english food_h3_5d19de9f:

    # L "夜神君看起来吃得很香，觉得味道怎么样？"
    L "It seems pleasing to Yagami-kun. How does it taste?"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:561
translate english food_h3_0b10c99c:

    # Y smile1 "我还是第一次吃到这种口味的复合黄油，味增口味的还挺适合拿来配面包的。"
    Y smile1 "It's my first-time trying compound butter of these flavors. The miso one is quite suitable to pair with buns."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:562
translate english food_h3_130a5ccc:

    # L "毕竟是六本木王道法餐Ryuzu的主推套餐嘛，本土化做得相当成功呢。"
    L "It's the signature menu from RYUZU, the quintessential French restaurant in Roppongi, after all. Their localization appears quite successful."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:564
translate english food_h3_949853d8_1:

    # "L一边回话一边揭开了下一层的圆盖，月瞧见两只碟碗，"
    "L replied while uncovering the next set of cloches. Light saw two bowls:"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:564
translate english food_h3_52867d61_1:

    # "一碗盛着由应季蔬果、白煮蛋和些许面包干拌好的小份沙拉，一碗则是清澈见底、能闻到些许香气的法式清汤。"
    " One held a small salad tossed with seasonal fruits and vegetables, boiled egg, and some croutons. The other held a crystal-clear consommé from which a slight aroma wafted."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:572
translate english food_h3_bf78f485:

    # "L简单地收拾了下餐前面包用到的餐具，随后将沙拉与清汤摆到了月的面前。"
    "L simply tidied up the tableware for the bread course and then placed the salad and the consommé in front of Light."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:572
translate english food_h3_6e1f22c8:

    # "沙拉里混合着应季的蔬菜和坚果，L舀起一勺沙拉靠近青年的嘴边时，月闻到了意大利香醋混合着蜂蜜的味道。"
    "The salad consisted of seasonal vegetables and nuts. When L scooped up a spoonful of salad and neared his mouth, Light smelled the aroma of balsamic vinegar mixed with honey."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:572
translate english food_h3_9f2ea3b0:

    # "酸甜的沙拉很好去除了刚才黄油面包的油腻，只是L翻拌沙拉的手法实在是太烂，喂过来的沙拉不是一点酱料都没有沾上、就是浸满了过酸的黑醋。"
    "The sweet and sour salad nicely cleared the richness of the buttered bun. However, L's mixing skill was so terrible that the spoonfuls of salad offered were either completely devoid of dressing or soaked in overly acidic vinegar."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:572
translate english food_h3_71d18908:

    # "几口之后月便受不了这种交替着折磨味蕾的行为，出声制止了L的喂食。"
    "After a few bites, Light could no longer stand this alternating torment for him and spoke up to stop L's feeding."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:580
translate english food_h3_4bbc6e56:

    # Y "……已经可以了，龙崎可以换成清汤了。"
    Y " ...That's enough, thanks for your kindness. Ryuzaki-kun, could you please switch to the consommé now?"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:581
translate english food_h3_67a942bf:

    # L surprise "夜神君讨厌吃蔬菜吗？为了健康起见我认为他还是多摄入一些维生素会比较好。"
    L surprise "Wouldn't Yagami-kun like vegetables? For the sake of your health, I think it could be better for you to take in more vitamins."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:583
translate english food_h3_d54dc2fb:

    # "月有些无语地看着L，他回想起在搜查总部时L那不健康的嗜糖饮食，毫不犹豫地出声抗议道。"
    " Light looked at L speechlessly. Recalling L's unhealthy sugar-heavy diet at the investigation headquarters, he protested without hesitation."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:585
translate english food_h3_f5f9119f:

    # Y "龙崎才应该多吃一点蔬菜吧？只吃甜品的话不论是心脏病还是糖尿病发病率都是常人的三倍以上。"
    Y "Shouldn't Ryuzaki be the one demanding for more vegetable intake? Living on sugary foods triples the risk of heart disease and diabetes compared to normal people."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:586
translate english food_h3_a9a6eba5:

    # Y "当然，如果龙崎能这么轻易死掉的话我也不会在这里了吧。"
    Y "Ah~yes, if Ryuzaki could die so easily, I probably wouldn't be here."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:588
translate english food_h3_5601d09b:

    # "L撇了撇嘴，他有些讨厌别人置喙自己的生活方式，"
    "L pursed his lips. He somewhat disliked others criticizing his lifestyle."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:588
translate english food_h3_a60cd891:

    # "但是面对已经在司法流程和自己私心下被二次关押超过两个月的夜神月，他承认作为上位者确实可以摆出一些宽容的姿态。"
    " But facing Light Yagami, who had been detained secondly for over two months due to his own personal bias after that by judicial processes, he admitted that as the one in power, he could afford to show some tolerance."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:593
translate english food_h3_7478687d:

    # "L只当月在发泄不满，在帮月简单擦拭了嘴角残留的酱汁后，便将清汤端了过来。"
    "L simply took it as Light's venting his dissatisfactions and brought over the consommé after wiping the residual sauce on the corner of Light's mouth."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:593
translate english food_h3_a5060847:

    # "L放下沙拉的餐叉，转而捏住汤匙银色的握柄，在确认汤品的温度适宜后送入了月的嘴中。"
    "L put down the salad fork before picking up the silver handle of the soup spoon. After confirming the temperature was suitable, he delivered it into Light's mouth."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:593
translate english food_h3_bbe5d0b9:

    # "蔬菜的甜美和肉类蛋白的复杂风味完全被锁在汤品中，使得咽下去后仍然回味生香，"
    "The sweetness of vegetables and the complex flavors of meat proteins were completely locked within the consommé, leaving a lingering aroma even after swallowing."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:593
translate english food_h3_90d19b38:

    # "碗中盛放的欧芹叶更为其增添了一抹清香，很好清去了舌尖上残留的黑醋风味，温暖肠胃的同时诱惑着食客期待起下一道佳肴。"
    "Parsley leaves in the salad added a touch of fresh scent, nicely clearing the residual taste of balsamic vinegar, which warmed the stomach while tempting the diner to look forward to the next delicacy."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:593
translate english food_h3_614b2de9:

    # "在汤碗见底后，L短暂地将空碗放到了囚室的地上，随后伸手端起了第三层的两个圆盖，连着餐盘一同送到了月的面前。"
    "After the soup bowl was empty, L temporarily placed the empty bowl on the cell floor, then reached out to fetch the two cloches from the third tier to the table."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:604
translate english food_h3_28cd782c:

    # "L面朝着月揭开了了第一个圆盖，底下雕金的瓷盘里整齐地码放着四块被酥皮包裹着的牛肉，"
    "L unveiled the first cloche. Beneath it, on a gold-rimmed porcelain plate, were four orderly-placed pieces of steak wrapped in puff pastry."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:604
translate english food_h3_8d930258:

    # "牛肉的火候掌握得正好、内里还呈现出浅嫩的粉色，用刀叉切开还会随着动作流淌出丰盈的肉汁。"
    "The steak was cooked just to perfection, still tenderly pink inside. Cutting it through would allow juices to spout."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:604
translate english food_h3_24223202:

    # "酥皮与牛肉间细细填充着半块油润的鹅肝和黑松露与口蘑炒制而成的蘑菇泥，用刀叉切开酥皮后又能窥见夹层间的火腿，"
    " Between the pastry and the steak was carefully filled with rich, oily foie gras and mushroom duxelles. A layer of ham within the layers of pastry could be spotted if cutting into the puffy pastry."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:604
translate english food_h3_125e2d6c:

    # "棕色的造型酱汁上佐以翠绿色的芦笋，几乎可以说是堪称满分的惠灵顿牛排出品。"
    "This dish was accompanied by Demi Glacé adorned with emerald, green asparagus. It should almost be called a perfect Beef Wellington."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:615
translate english food_h3_c52be788:

    # "L先将沙拉和刚才的空碗换位、拿到第一层摆到了月的面前，专用的沙拉叉被一并码在餐盘旁边。"
    "L first exchanged the positions of the salad bowl and the empty soup bowl, taking the salad to the first tier in front of Light. The salad fork was placed alongside the plate."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:615
translate english food_h3_4e4ff323:

    # "月观察着沙拉，在L将碗盘挪近后他看清了更多细节："
    "Light observed as L pushed the bowl towards him. He now could see more details:"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:615
translate english food_h3_54ff9012:

    # "除去鲜果外，这份沙拉还混入了圣女果干和磨碎的起司，沙拉表面细细淋了些意大利黑醋。"
    "Besides fresh fruits, this salad also included sun-dried cherry tomatoes and grated cheese with Italian balsamic vinegar delicately drizzled on the surface."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:615
translate english food_h3_d192d9d9:

    # "月用叉子插入沙拉底部翻拌，橄榄油便和黑醋混合在一块，上下包裹起每一片蔬菜。"
    "Light inserted his fork into the bottom of the salad and tossed it. He mixed the olive oil with the balsamic vinegar, coating each piece of vegetable."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:615
translate english food_h3_f5a88d98:

    # "在刚才黄油浓厚的味道对味蕾造成冲击后，酸甜的蔬果沙拉很好起到了清口的作用，月一口接一口叉起沙拉送入口中，很快将碗内的食物一扫而空。"
    "After the impact of those rich butter flavors, the sweet and sour fruit and vegetable salad well served his need to cleanse his mouth. Forkful by forkful, Light put the salad into his mouth, clearing the food in the bowl."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:627
translate english food_h3_8659711b:

    # "摆在右手边汤碗里的是法餐中对技巧要求相当严苛的清汤，月只在母亲幸子收藏的法国菜谱中见过做法———"
    "On the right was a bowl of consommé, which requires considerable skills in French cuisine. Light had only seen the method in the French cookbook his mother, Sachiko, collected—"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:627
translate english food_h3_dd2f50bc:

    # "将蔬菜细细切碎后和蛋清搅打均匀、再加入碎牛肉猪肉混合制成肉糜，倒入鸡高汤和肉糜一同熬煮几个小时，"
    " Finely chopping vegetables, whipping them evenly with egg whites, adding minced beef and pork to make a meat paste, pouring into chicken stock and simmering with the meat paste for several hours."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:627
translate english food_h3_cb145704:

    # "依靠蛋白质吸附杂质，最终得到一碗看似白水、味道却极度鲜美的高汤。"
    "Though simply using proteins to adsorb impurities, it unbelievably results in a broth that looks like clear water but tastes meatier than tenderloins."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:627
translate english food_h3_294250e1:

    # "月握住汤勺的匙柄，舀起一勺清汤送入口中，蔬菜的甜美和肉类蛋白的复杂风味完全被锁在汤品中，使得咽下去后仍然回味生香，"
    "Light held the handle of the soup spoon, scooped up some consommé, and delivered to his mouth. The sweetness of the vegetables and the complex flavor of meat proteins were locked down within the consommé, leaving a lingering aroma even after swallowing."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:627
translate english food_h3_90d19b38_1:

    # "碗中盛放的欧芹叶更为其增添了一抹清香，很好清去了舌尖上残留的黑醋风味，温暖肠胃的同时诱惑着食客期待起下一道佳肴。"
    "Parsley leaves placed in the bowl added a touch of fresh scent, nicely clearing the residual taste of balsamic vinegar, which warmed the stomach while tempting the diner to look forward to the next delicacy."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:627
translate english food_h3_b7dba1af:

    # "L在月进食完后收起了碗碟，他短暂地将空碗放到了囚室的地上，随后伸手端起了第三层的两个圆盖，连着餐盘一同送到了月的面前。"
    "After Light finished all the entrées, L collected the bowls and plates. He temporarily placed the empty bowls on the cell floor, then reached out to fetch the two cloches from the third tier to the table."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:641
translate english food_h3_0ae52ee1:

    # "L揭开了第一个圆盖，底下雕金的瓷盘里整齐地码放着四块被酥皮包裹着的牛肉，"
    "L unveiled the first cloche. Beneath it, on a gold-rimmed porcelain plate, were four orderly-placed pieces of steak wrapped in puff pastry."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:641
translate english food_h3_8d930258_1:

    # "牛肉的火候掌握得正好、内里还呈现出浅嫩的粉色，用刀叉切开还会随着动作流淌出丰盈的肉汁。"
    "The steak was cooked just to perfection, still tenderly pink inside. Cutting it through would allow juices to spout."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:641
translate english food_h3_24223202_1:

    # "酥皮与牛肉间细细填充着半块油润的鹅肝和黑松露与口蘑炒制而成的蘑菇泥，用刀叉切开酥皮后又能窥见夹层间的火腿，"
    " Between the pastry and the steak was carefully filled with rich, oily foie gras and mushroom duxelles. A layer of ham within the layers of pastry could be spotted if cutting into the puffy pastry. "

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:641
translate english food_h3_125e2d6c_1:

    # "棕色的造型酱汁上佐以翠绿色的芦笋，几乎可以说是堪称满分的惠灵顿牛排出品。"
    "This dish was accompanied by Demi Glacé adorned with emerald, green asparagus. It should almost be called a perfect Beef Wellington."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:653
translate english food_h3_b121c80f:

    # L smile3 "月君知道这道餐品的正式名称是Beef Willington吗？"
    L smile3 "Yagami-kun, did you know the formal name for this dish is Beef Wellington?"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:654
translate english food_h3_6890bdf6:

    # L "相传这道菜品是因为第一位惠灵顿公爵在滑铁卢战役中击败了拿破仑而得名的，"
    L "It is said to be named after the first Duke of Wellington who defeated Napoleon at the Battle of Waterloo. "

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:654
translate english food_h3_7bd16248:

    # L "首次亮相便是那场战役的庆功宴，所以使用的食材多是当时贵族御用的材料，算得上极尽奢华。"
    L "Its first show-off was at the victory banquet for that battle, so the ingredients used were mostly those reserved for the nobility, considered as an extremely luxurious feast."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:658
translate english food_h3_0f42292e:

    # "月方才还有些期待这道卖相上佳的菜品，他在三十秒前也确实感谢过L的菜品介绍，额外的知识在解闷的同时的确也为菜品增色不少———"
    "Light had been looking forward to this well-presented dish just moments ago. Thirty seconds prior, he had also been indeed grateful to L's introduction to the dishes cause the entertaining extra knowledge did add to the enjoyment of the meal— "

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:658
translate english food_h3_67f14ef6:

    # "但现在他只想把这道寓意讨厌的菜砸到L那张讨厌的脸上，然后叫L远远地滚出去。"
    "But now what he wanted to do all was to smash this dish with its annoying symbolism right into L's annoying face and storm L to get the hell out."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:662
translate english food_h3_c12a4ae8:

    # Y angry "你这是什么意思？费尽心思请人做了一顿大餐来羞辱我？"
    Y angry "What do you mean by this? Going through all the trouble to have someone prepare a grand meal only to humiliate me?"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:663
translate english food_h3_d1fdda8d:

    # Y "还真是相当有闲空啊，伟大的L在获胜之后没有别的事情可以干了，居然以侮辱阶下囚为乐。"
    Y "You are really extravagant with your time. The Great L, after winning Kira, has nothing better to do than amusing himself by insulting his poor prisoner?"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:664
translate english food_h3_8bee5c70:

    # L confused "夜神君误会了，我没有那个意思。"
    L confused "Yagami-kun, this might be a misunderstanding. I never meant that."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:665
translate english food_h3_a039f4b4:

    # Y "那你倒是解释一下呢？龙崎？"
    Y "Then please explain it, huh? Ryuzaki-kun?"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:666
translate english food_h3_525e120b:

    # L pt "这道菜是法餐的经典菜品……夜神君知道六本木的王道法餐Ryuzu吗？"
    L pt "This dish is a classic French cuisine... Does Yagami-kun know RYUZU, the quintessential French restaurant in Roppongi?"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:666
translate english food_h3_83982154:

    # L pt "我只是订购了他们家的主推套餐，当然，餐品的介绍也是原样照搬了宣传册上的语句。"
    L pt "I just ordered their signature menu. Of course, my dish introductions are also copied word for word from the brochure."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:669
translate english food_h3_2d928ef3:

    # L unhappy "……抱歉，如果让夜神君不愉快的话，请当作我什么都没说过吧。"
    L unhappy "...Sorry. If  Yagami-kun is uncomfortable to this, please pretend I've said nothing."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:671
translate english food_h3_4d6588d5:

    # "月没有接过L的话头，他相当厌恶地闭上了眼睛，以此来表示今天和L言尽于此，他不会再多说一个字。"
    "Light gave no response to L's words. He closed his eyes with considerable disgust, indicating that he was done speaking with L today and wouldn't say a word."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:671
translate english food_h3_527bc2fe:

    # "不论L再怎么尝试和月对话，也没有得到任何除了沉默以外的回复。"
    "No matter what L tried to converse with Light about, he received no reply other than silence."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:671
translate english food_h3_09649bc3:

    # "L只能放弃了接下来的喂食行动，推着餐车离开了囚室。"
    "L could do nothing but abandon the subsequent feeding and pushed the meal cart out of the cell."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:683
translate english food_h3_a8d877f4:

    # "L相当贴心地为月摆上了更换用的餐具，餐叉、锯齿状的餐刀，和一柄木质把手的甜品餐叉。"
    "L thoughtfully laid replacement tableware for Light: a dinner fork, a serrated steak knife, and a wooden-handled dessert fork."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:683
translate english food_h3_bfb9e749:

    # "月捏住餐刀的匙柄，从中间切开惠灵顿牛排，随后将牛肉连着酥皮一同翻面，叉起一块送入嘴中。"
    "Light held the handle of the steak knife, cut the Beef Wellington from the middle, then flipped a piece of beef with the puffy pastry, forked it, and delivered it into his mouth."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:683
translate english food_h3_25297bc2:

    # "黑松露独有的菌菇香气很快席卷了口腔，浓醇的鹅肝入口即化、配上微咸的火腿进一步迸发出鲜味，柔软的牛里脊肉汁饱满，在咀嚼间渐渐和其他食材融为一体。"
    "The unique fungal aroma of black truffle quickly overwhelmed his mouth. The rich foie gras melted in a sudden, paired with the slightly salty ham, and further burst into rich umami. The tenderloins were full of juices, gradually blending with the other ingredients while chewing."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:683
translate english food_h3_892adc69:

    # "月不时切开芦笋、沾满酱汁后一道送入口中，蔬菜甘美的甜味缓解了牛排的油腻，总让人忍不住舀起第二口美味的菜肴。"
    "Light cut off a section of asparagus occasionally, dipped it fully in sauce, and ate it out. The crunchy and sweet flavor relieved the oily richness of the steak, always hurry him into a second mouthful of the delicious dish. "

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:683
translate english food_h3_a87789d1:

    # "惠灵顿牛排很快就在月的攻势下被一扫而光。月拿起餐巾擦了擦嘴，在等待L撤掉盘子的功夫观察起最后一道收尾的甜品。"
    "Light finished up Beef Wellington at an astonishing rate. He then picked up the serviette and wiped his mouth. While waiting for L to clear the plate, he observed the final dessert course."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:694
translate english food_h3_6d45d923:

    # "L端上来的第二个圆盘里装着压轴的树莓蛋糕，"
    "The second cloche L brought contained the finale, a raspberry cake."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:694
translate english food_h3_6dfbca65:

    # "切成长方形的蛋糕有着漂亮的横截面，奶油和果酱层层交叠着，最上层封上了厚厚的奶酪，顶端则点缀着一颗颗淋着糖浆的树莓。"
    " This rectangular piece of cake had a beautiful cross-section, with layers of cream and jam alternating. The top was blanketed with a generous layer of cream cheese, dotted with syrup-drizzled raspberries."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:694
translate english food_h3_efd6dfc4:

    # "月用餐叉切开蛋糕的一角，白色的奶酪经过调味在入口时不显厚重，果酱夹层恰到好处提供了水果丰盈的气味，"
    "Light used the dessert fork to cut off a corner of the cake. The seasoned cream cheese didn't taste heavy upon entering the mouth because the jam layer provided just the right amount of fruits' abundant scents. "

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:694
translate english food_h3_6ed48da6:

    # "顶端的覆盆子在咀嚼时爆开、流露出内里酸甜的果汁。"
    "The raspberries on top burst when chewed, releasing their sweet and sour juice inside."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:694
translate english food_h3_067591f3:

    # "最后的甜品对月来说略显甜腻，即使他再努力也依旧剩下半块蛋糕留在碟子中央。"
    "The final dessert was a bit too sweet and creamy for Light. Even though he tried, half of the cake remained on the plate."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:704
translate english food_h3_a5665216:

    # L surprise "怎么了夜神君？蛋糕还没有吃完哦。"
    L surprise "Is something not up to much, Yagami-kun? The cake hasn't been finished yet."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:705
translate english food_h3_acb0fcfe:

    # Y pt "……我已经吃饱了。"
    Y pt "...I'm full already."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:706
translate english food_h3_526ffdd5:

    # L order2 "是这样吗？这家甜品的调味做得很棒，也是我个人排行榜的Top.10呢。如果夜神君不吃的话，剩下的可以让给我吗？"
    L order2 "Is that so? The seasoning of this dessert is excellent; it's also in my personal top 10 ranking. If Yagami-kun isn't to eat it, may I have the rest?"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:707
translate english food_h3_5fbbc878:

    # Y "可以是可以，但是龙崎在来之前应该已经吃过饭了吧？"
    Y "Of course you can, but Ryuzaki should have already had dinner before, right?"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:708
translate english food_h3_a502e58e:

    # L smile1 "是啊，不过看见月君吃得那么美味的样子，总感觉肚子又饿了呢。"
    L smile1 "Yes, but seeing Yagami-kun enjoy the food indulgently, I feel hungry again somehow."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:709
translate english food_h3_26a19113:

    # Y han "（……完全搞不懂龙崎在想什么）"
    Y han "(......I cannot understand what Ryuzaki is thinking at all.)"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:711
translate english food_h3_06f52d42:

    # "月纠结了一会，还是伸手将剩下的半块蛋糕推到了L那边，黑发男人相当灵巧地跨过月坐上囚室的床铺，接过月递来的餐刀开始消灭起蛋糕。"
    "Light hesitated for a moment but still pushed the remaining half  towards L. The black-haired man quite deftly stepped over Light and sat on the cell bed, took the dessert fork offered by Light, and began to devour the cake."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:713
translate english food_h3_3fa32c87:

    # Y jiaoji3 "（等下，这把叉子好像就是自己刚才用的那把吧？！）"
    Y jiaoji3 "(Wait, isn't this fork the one I was just using?!)"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:715
translate english food_h3_9786d6b3:

    # "意识到了什么不对的月耳根迅速红了起来，想阻止L吞咽的动作又晚上一步，只能眼睁睁地看着甜品被L吞吃入腹。"
    "Light's ears quickly turned red as he realized something was wrong. His attempt to stop L from swallowing was a step too late; he could only helplessly watch L consuming the dessert till the last bite."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:715
translate english food_h3_73c14ffc:

    # "侦探甚至细细舔去了餐叉上的奶油，直到再也尝不出甜味后才依依不舍地放下叉子收拾起餐具。"
    "The detective even meticulously licked the cream off the fork. He didn't put the fork down until he could no longer taste any sweetness, and reluctantly started to collect the tableware."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:719
translate english food_h3_6d782e11:

    # L smile3 "一如既往的美味，感谢月君的招待。"
    L smile3 "Delicious as always. Thank you for your treat, Yagami-kun."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:720
translate english food_h3_05671f09:

    # "月有些不自在地看着那把甜品餐叉，吞吞吐吐地跟着L一起说出结语。"
    "Light looked at that dessert fork kind of uncomfortably, stammering out the closing phrase along with L."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:721
translate english food_h3_3d642a25:

    # Y pt "……我吃饱了，感谢招待。"
    Y pt " ...Thank you for the meal. I'm done."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:723
translate english food_h3_39fe6a26:

    # "在短暂的插曲过后，L重新为月戴上手铐和脚镣，推着餐车离开了囚室。"
    "After this brief interlude, L re-cuffed Light's hands and feet and left the cell with the cart."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:723
translate english food_h3_1a7cf6d5:

    # "只是这一次，月盯着L离去的背影，一点点陷入了沉思。"
    "For the first time since he was caged, Light stared at L's retreating, slowly sinking deep into thought."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:729
translate english food_h4_2a01c200:

    # "今天L推着餐车来到囚室时月正在床上闭眼小憩，长时间的囚禁生活似乎十分消耗青年的精力，他的体重比进入囚室时要轻上许多，"
    "When L wheeled the serving trolley into the room today, Light was dozing on the bed. The prolonged captivity seemed to have drained the young man of energy—he weighed less than when he first stepped into the room. "

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:729
translate english food_h4_73538e69:

    # "这使得L不得不大幅提升日常饮食的质量，让月从三餐中获取足够的营养。"
    "L had to greatly improve the quality of his daily food to ensure he got enough nutrients through eating."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:733
translate english food_h4_812e9220:

    # L "夜神君，已经到吃饭的时间了。"
    L "Yagami-kun, it's time to eat,"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:734
translate english food_h4_8797a62e:

    # "L拍了拍躺在床上的青年，尝试把仍在睡梦中的月扶起来吃饭。月对突入其来的触碰表现出了不满，闷哼着就想挣脱开继续躺回床铺。"
    "L said, patting the young man lying on the bed as he tried to get the still-sleeping Light up for his meal. Annoyed by the sudden touch, Light grumbled and tried to squirm away, desperate to sink back into the mattress. "

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:735
translate english food_h4_454d3465:

    # Y ditou "唔……龙崎……"
    Y ditou "Mmm…Ryuzaki…"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:736
translate english food_h4_ecc9b9a8:

    # Y "让我再睡一会……"
    Y "just a little longer…"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:737
translate english food_h4_e754bfa4:

    # L surprise "（夜神这是睡迷糊了吗，为什么语气听起来有点像在撒娇？）"
    L surprise "Is Light still half-asleep? Why does his tone sound almost like he's cooing?"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:738
translate english food_h4_386086b3:

    # "在L坚持不懈的努力下月终于开始有了苏醒的迹象，他直起身子坐到了床边，顶着一头乱蓬蓬的头发，睡眼惺忪地打着哈欠。"
    "After persistent efforts from L, Light finally began to stir. He sat up on the bedside, hair uncombed, and yawned drowsily. "

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:738
translate english food_h4_e9511682:

    # "兴许是青年迷糊的样子削弱了平日里两人剑拔弩张的气氛，L鬼使神差地伸出手，摸了摸月的脑袋，从前往后捋顺了月有些杂乱的发丝。"
    "Perhaps it was the young man's muzzy demeanor that softened the usually tense atmosphere between them—on a whim, L reached out and gently smoothed Light's tousled hair back from his forehead. "

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:741
translate english food_h4_66d00e1d:

    # L thinking "（原来夜神的头发是这种触感的）"
    L thinking "(So this is what Light's hair feels like.)"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:747
translate english food_h4_ba27f41d:

    # "L没有解开月手铐的意思，只是从餐盘上拿起塑封好的热毛巾帮月简单擦拭了一下面部，"
    "L made no move to uncuff Light. Instead, he picked up an individually-wrapped hot towel from the tray and gently wiped Light's face. "

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:747
translate english food_h4_23b9e3d1:

    # "月这会完全醒了过来，意识到刚刚L抚摸自己脑袋的举动后有些不自在地和躲开L擦拭的动作，扭动着向后和L拉开了一点距离。"
    "By now fully awake, Light realized what L had just done—running a hand over his head—and suddenly felt awkward. He flinched from the towel, twisting away to put a little more distance between them."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:751
translate english food_h4_818d5850:

    # Y pt "龙崎不是来送饭的吗？那就不要做多余的动作了，我们没有那么亲昵吧。"
    Y pt "Aren't you here to bring me food, Ryuzaki? Then don't do anything unnecessary. We're not that close."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:752
translate english food_h4_86aebce2:

    # L pt "啊，只是确保清洁的擦拭而已，夜神君不用在意。"
    L pt "Ah, just a quick wipe to make sure you're clean. No need to mind it, Yagami-kun."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:753
translate english food_h4_375c3d2c:

    # Y renzhen "我说的明明是你不经同意就摸我头发的行为。"
    Y renzhen "I'm clearly talking about you touching my hair without even asking."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:754
translate english food_h4_7c4170dc:

    # L surprise "……那是因为夜神君看上去很好摸…？"
    L surprise "…Because, well, you looked like you'd be really nice to touch…?"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:755
translate english food_h4_08e42a16:

    # Y surprise "为什么是疑问句？？"
    Y surprise "Why did you phrase it as a question??"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:759
translate english food_h4_f984c66e:

    # "L没有继续回应月的问题，他揭开了餐车上的保温罩，下方中规中矩地摆放着一只白色的瓷盘，"
    "L offered no further reply. He lifted the food cover from the trolley to reveal a plain white porcelain plate:"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:759
translate english food_h4_d57c4123:

    # "一块炖到酥烂的牛肉上点缀着零散的罗勒香叶，周边依次散落着成块的胡萝卜和圆球形的小颗洋葱，散发着浓郁红酒与酱油香气的酱汁满满盛在盘中。"
    "a single piece of beef stewed until it was meltingly tender yet delightfully crisp on the outside, scattered with a few basil leaves for color, ringed by neat cubes of carrot and pearl onions, all bathed in a gravy that carried the deep, mingled scent of red wine and soy sauce."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:759
translate english food_h4_5ad5d8b1:

    # "L用刀叉仔细地切下一块牛肉浸上酱汁，又舀起一点土豆泥放到餐勺上，最后将牛肉和小块的蔬菜移到土豆泥上方，组合成小份的红酒炖牛肉喂到月的嘴边。"
    "With deliberate care, L cut a cube of beef, let it bathe in the sauce, then scooped a small mound of mashed potato onto the spoon. He set the beef and a few diced vegetables on the potato, forming a neat mouthful, and brought the spoon to Light's lips."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:759
translate english food_h4_e07a5c7b:

    # "炖肉选用了上好的牛肋条，肉类在高温下完美的美拉德反应带来了焦香浓郁的味道，"
    "The stew had been built on prime rib fingers. High heat coaxed out a deeply caramelized Maillard crust;"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:759
translate english food_h4_15c86199:

    # "胡萝卜和洋葱在炖煮后仍然保留了蔬菜的香甜，和着微酸的红酒酱汁十分解腻。"
    "the carrots and onions, long-simmered yet still bright, kept their natural sweetness, and the faintly tart red-wine gravy cut cleanly through the richness."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:759
translate english food_h4_8fe7cdc0:

    # "打底的土豆泥也细细拌入了黄油，甚至还保留了些许小块土豆以增添咀嚼时的口感。"
    "The mashed potatoes that formed the base had been folded with butter, and small chunks of potato were left in for texture with every bite."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:773
translate english food_h4_f9703533:

    # "月相当满意地品味着这道炖菜料理，在完食后仍意犹未尽地盯着L收拾餐具的举动，他又想起L刚进入囚室时抚摸自己头部的奇怪动作。"
    "ored the stew with evident satisfaction; even after the last bite, he kept his gaze on L while the latter cleared the dishes. Thoughts drifting back to that odd, unbidden stroke to his hair when L had just come into the room."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:773
translate english food_h4_3f956aba:

    # "如果L对自己有那方面想法的话……或许和L建立比较良好的关系也不错？"
    "If L had that kind of interest in him… perhaps forging a good relationship with L wouldn't be so bad after all."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:779
translate english food_h4_463d6d4e:

    # "在正式进食前L替月解开了手铐和脚镣，刚起床的青年还带着困意，磨磨蹭蹭地走到洗手池旁拧开水龙头，简单捧起水清理了一下面部刷了个牙。"
    "Before the meal, L had unbolted shackles on Light's hands and feet. The young man rose, still drowsy. He shuffled to the sink, turned on the faucet, then cupped some water to rinse his face and brushed his teeth."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:779
translate english food_h4_20610f05:

    # "L跟在一旁，在恰到好处的时机把毛巾递给月。"
    "L stood nearby and timed it perfectly to hand Light a towel."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:782
translate english food_h4_5ea7636e:

    # L pt "请用。"
    L pt "Here."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:783
translate english food_h4_829b99c4:

    # Y pt "……谢谢。"
    Y pt "…Thanks."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:785
translate english food_h4_0180ae39:

    # "L看着月坐回床上，像只睡到餍足的猫似地伸起懒腰。"
    "L watched Light sit back on the bed and stretch like a cat sated with sleep."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:785
translate english food_h4_0b4e9969:

    # "L将餐车推到月的面前，他揭开了餐车上的保温罩，并将用餐巾包好的餐具递给月。"
    "L wheeled the serving trolley up to Light, lifted the food cover, and handed him the cutlery wrapped in a napkin."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:792
translate english food_h4_4f62f386:

    # "月看见保温罩的下方中规中矩地摆放着一只白色的瓷盘，一块炖到酥烂的牛肉上点缀着零散的罗勒香叶，"
    "As Light saw, beneath the cover was a plain white porcelain plate: a single piece of beef stewed until it was meltingly tender, with a slight crust on the outside, scattered with a few basil leaves for color,"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:792
translate english food_h4_0e366213:

    # "周边依次散落着成块的胡萝卜和圆球形的小颗洋葱，散发着浓郁红酒与酱油香气的酱汁满满盛在盘中。"
    "ringed by neat cubes of carrot and pearl onions, all bathed in a gravy that carried the deep, mingled scent of red wine and soy sauce."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:796
translate english food_h4_8faa44d2:

    # Y smile1 "我开动了。"
    Y smile1 "Thank you for the meal."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:798
translate english food_h4_bbda7705:

    # "在简短的饭前例行公事后，浓郁的香气很快促使着月用刀叉仔细地切下一块牛肉浸上酱汁，"
    "After the brief pre-meal courtesy, the rich aroma coaxed Light into action. He cut a cube of beef, let it bathe in the sauce,"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:798
translate english food_h4_ab709893:

    # "他又舀起一点土豆泥放到餐勺上，最后将牛肉和小块的蔬菜移到土豆泥上方，组合成小份的红酒炖牛肉送入嘴中。"
    "then scooped a small mound of mashed potato onto the spoon. Light set the beef and a few diced vegetables on the potato, forming a neat mouthful, and put it into his mouth."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:798
translate english food_h4_d5b6c803:

    # "月能品尝出炖肉选用了上好的牛肋条，肉类在高温下完美的美拉德反应带来了焦香浓郁的味道，"
    "Light could tell the stew had been built on prime rib fingers. High heat coaxed out a deeply caramelized Maillard crust;"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:798
translate english food_h4_15c86199_1:

    # "胡萝卜和洋葱在炖煮后仍然保留了蔬菜的香甜，和着微酸的红酒酱汁十分解腻。"
    "the carrots and onions, long-simmered yet still bright, kept their natural sweetness, and the faintly tart red-wine gravy cut cleanly through the richness."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:798
translate english food_h4_8fe7cdc0_1:

    # "打底的土豆泥也细细拌入了黄油，甚至还保留了些许小块土豆以增添咀嚼时的口感。"
    "The mashed potatoes that formed the base had been folded with butter, and small chunks of potato were left in for texture with every bite."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:798
translate english food_h4_ef7fbd38:

    # "月相当满意地品味着这道炖菜料理，"
    "Light savored the stew with evident satisfaction;"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:798
translate english food_h4_9d3a216b:

    # "虽然是没吃过的食谱，不过近日来逐渐丰富起来的菜式的确很好缓解了他的精神压力，让月不自觉地期待起下一餐L会带来什么。"
    "It was a recipe he'd never tasted before, yet the steadily more varied dishes of recent days had quietly eased his mental strain, and Light found himself looking forward—almost unconsciously—to whatever L might bring next."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:812
translate english food_h4_bdd74bec:

    # "月很快用牛肉配着土豆泥将整碟菜肴吃了个精光，他盯着L收拾餐具时的背影，没来由地在脑海中冒出一句话。"
    "Light ate every bite of it, each spoonful layering beef over mash, then watched L's back while he cleared the dishes. A thought popped into his mind:"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:812
translate english food_h4_a157b9a1:

    # "如果可以利用L的好感来改善生活条件的话……也许是时候选择缓和两人的关系了。"
    "If he could leverage L's fondness to improve his living conditions, perhaps it was time to play nice with L."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:818
translate english food_h5_74e3bb79:

    # "L推着金属制的银色餐车进入了囚室，今天推车上多了一台便携式卡式炉，炉灶上放着一只砂锅，锅盖上的气孔随着炖煮一股股向外喷着热气。"
    "L wheeled the silver metal trolley into the room. Today, besides the usual dishes, it carried a portable gas stove. On its ring sat a casserole; plumes of steam pulsed from the vent hole in the lid as it stewed."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:818
translate english food_h5_3bbddf9c:

    # "月能从空气的流动中闻到很美妙的味道，一丝丝海产品的鲜香不断顺着呼吸钻入他的鼻腔。"
    "An aroma in the air wafted towards Light. The briny sweetness of fresh seafood kept filling his nose."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:818
translate english food_h5_fb46ffc0:

    # "L很快将推车送到了月的面前，除去冒出香味的砂锅外，餐车最上层摆着一碟瓷盘，里头孤零零地盛着一颗西兰花。"
    "L wheeled the trolley up to Light. Besides the aromatic casserole, the top tier held a single porcelain plate with one lone broccoli."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:818
translate english food_h5_a96eb0cc:

    # "瓷盘旁则有一只装满米饭的小碗，最上面随意地撒了些黑芝麻作为点缀。"
    "Beside it, there was a small bowl of rice with black sesame sprinkled on it."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:818
translate english food_h5_4c7fa251:

    # "L当着月的面揭开了砂锅，锅内咕嘟咕嘟地煮着圆形的花菇和足有成年人手掌大小的干鲍，褐色的汤汁均匀地裹在食材上，"
    "L lifted the lid in front of Light. Inside the casserole, the ingredients were bubbling. Round shiitake mushrooms and dried abalones—each the size of a grown man's palm—all coated in a glossy brown sauce."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:828
translate english food_h5_934ba7b4:

    # "L用餐叉将鲍鱼与花菇捞起，小心翼翼地放到瓷盘上，随后提起勺子为餐盘内的食物淋上熬煮后香气四溢的浓稠汤汁，在稍加调整后将整盘餐食送到了月的面前。"
    "With a fork, L lifted the abalones and mushrooms from the casserole and set them carefully onto the porcelain plate. He then spooned the aromatic, thickened sauce over them. After a quick food presentation, L put the plate in front of Light."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:836
translate english food_h5_5f20dce8:

    # "L将沾上酱汁的的餐具随意丢到了一旁，他没有凑近月解开青年手铐的意思，只是从餐车的第二层拿起新的一套餐具切割起盘内摆放整齐的食物。"
    "L tossed the sauce-stained fork away without ceremony. He made no move to get closer and uncuff Light; instead, he picked up a fresh set of cutlery from the trolley's lower tier and began cutting the neatly arranged food on the plate."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:836
translate english food_h5_25393722:

    # "餐刀向下切开鲍鱼，鲍鱼滑弹的肉质顺着L施力的方向一点点分开，将内里柔软的溏心质地展露在月的面前。"
    "L pressed the knife into the abalone; its springy and smooth meat parted slowly, revealing the soft, tender core to Light's eyes."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:836
translate english food_h5_51b7324c:

    # "L简单地将鲍鱼一分为二，又从边角上切下一块沾了沾酱汁，用叉子顶住鲍鱼肉送到月的嘴边。"
    "L halved the abalone with a single stroke, then trimmed a bite-sized piece, coated it in the sauce, and brought it to Light's lips with the fork."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:836
translate english food_h5_b1de582d:

    # "月在咬下的瞬间便感受到了鲍鱼充盈的胶质，炖煮后的鲍汁更显鲜美，浓郁的蛋白融入到汤汁后变得粘稠，"
    "The instant Light bit down, he felt the abalone was full of collagen. The simmer sauce had only grown more umami-rich; the proteins in the sauce had thickened it into a gooey glaze."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:836
translate english food_h5_53a9d5c4:

    # "海鲜豪迈的味道迅速席卷了味蕾，筋道的肉质在咀嚼时不断回弹，进一步展现出鲍鱼独特的口感。"
    "A bold, savory seafood flavor swept across his palate, while the springy meat sprang back with each chew, laying bare the abalone's unique texture."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:836
translate english food_h5_d5d18cb0:

    # "鲍鱼靠近中部的溏心呈现出半透明的质感，除去Q弹外还保有了些许软糯，鲜美的回味只让人食欲大开地想要吃下第二口。"
    "Near the center, the abalone's translucent core was almost jelly-like—springy yet faintly soft. Its lingering flavor left him craving another bite."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:836
translate english food_h5_5aa51b0b:

    # "在咀嚼鲍鱼的时候，月瞥见了一旁被L冷落的米饭和花菇，即使是十分美味的餐点，碍于面子他还是先尝试等待L会交换食材的顺序喂食———"
    "As Light chewed the abalone, he glanced at the rice and mushrooms L had left untouched. Delicious as everything was, pride kept him silent—he waited, hoping L would switch the order and offer them next."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:836
translate english food_h5_969b7f0e:

    # "不过在鲍鱼只剩一半时，侦探还是没有任何动作。"
    "But when only half the abalone remained, the detective still hadn't made a move."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:836
translate english food_h5_c9f98c91:

    # "月不得不出声提醒L这种浪费的行为。"
    "Light had to remind L not to waste food."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:854
translate english food_h5_7466e10b:

    # Y "龙崎，我需要摄取主食和蔬菜。"
    Y "Ryuzaki, I need staple food and vegetables."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:855
translate english food_h5_8307bc08:

    # L "请安心夜神君，我没有遗忘这一点，只是我觉得按顺序来会比较顺手罢了。"
    L "Relax, Yagami-kun. I haven't forgotten—just feels more natural to keep to the order."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:856
translate english food_h5_cf257434:

    # Y renzhen "用鲍汁配饭或菜是最基本的食用方法吧？还是说龙崎打算最后让我用水煮西兰花配着白饭吃么。"
    Y renzhen "Consuming the abalone sauce with rice or vegetables is basic common sense, isn't it? Or were you planning to finish me off with boiled broccoli and plain rice?"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:857
translate english food_h5_e311bf5c:

    # L surprise "我是有这个打算，夜神君有什么疑问吗？"
    L surprise "Precisely. Any objection, Yagami-kun?"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:858
translate english food_h5_0e5a57e1:

    # Y renzhen "当然啊！怎么会有这样的吃法啊！"
    Y renzhen "Of course I have! Who eats like that?"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:859
translate english food_h5_c7869e03:

    # L order1 "我知道了，夜神君，你先冷静一点。进食时情绪波动太大会影响消化的。"
    L order1 "All right, Yagami-kun—easy does it. Strong emotions at the table play havoc with digestion."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:860
translate english food_h5_5436f44c:

    # Y han "所以还不是要怪你搭配食物的手法太烂……"
    Y han "Then blame it on your terrible food matches…"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:862
translate english food_h5_dc675842:

    # "L似乎真的听进去了月的提议，他转而从餐刀切下了一块花菇，并舀起一口米饭放到餐勺里，和沾满鲍汁的花菇一块送到了月的嘴边。"
    "L seemed to take the point. He cut a slice of shiitake mushroom coated in abalone sauce and scooped a mouthful of rice onto the spoon. Then he brought the spoon to Light's lips."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:864
translate english food_h5_ab6f7e4f:

    # L pt "按照夜神君刚才的要求做了，现在可以继续吃了吧？"
    L pt "Per your request. Shall we continue?"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:865
translate english food_h5_966fae88:

    # Y pt "不要说得好像这是什么无理的要求一样。"
    Y pt "Don't make it sound like an unreasonable demand."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:867
translate english food_h5_d9c67474:

    # "月懒得继续搭理这个奇怪的人，只是颇为安静地吃着改变了喂食顺序的餐点，"
    "Light couldn't be bothered to argue with this odd guy any longer; he ate the rest in silence, now served in the order he'd asked for."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:867
translate english food_h5_0f69b4d9:

    # "两个人迅速回归到沉默的状态，囚室内一时间只有零散的咀嚼声和金属餐具碰撞碗碟的声音。"
    "They lapsed back into silence at once, the room filling only with sporadic crunching and the clatter of dishes."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:871
translate english food_h5_c60fb755:

    # Y "很美味的一餐，多谢款待。"
    Y "They're delicious. Thank you, Ryuzaki."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:875
translate english food_h5_1438ea51:

    # "L闻言停下了继续喂食的动作，关闭了卡式炉的开关，将用脏的餐具简单丢到砂锅里面盖上了锅盖，确保没有遗漏后推着餐车离开了囚室。"
    "At Light's words, L set the spoon aside, clicked off the gas stove, and casually dropped the used cutlery into the casserole before putting the lid on. After making sure nothing was left behind, he wheeled the trolley out of the room."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:881
translate english food_h5_6d61702b:

    # "L绕到月的后方，用钥匙插进锁孔为青年解开了手铐。月活动了下有些酸痛的肩膀，在用餐车上准备好的热毛巾擦拭双手时出声问道。"
    "Going round the back of Light, L unlocked the cuffs with a key. Light rolled his stiff shoulders. Then he wiped his hands on the provided hot towel and asked."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:883
translate english food_h5_93af1a93:

    # Y "怎么今天突然有兴趣解开我的手铐了？"
    Y "Why the sudden urge to take off my handcuffs today?"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:884
translate english food_h5_d1ac4eed:

    # L "渡说今天的餐点需要保持加热的状态，每个人对温度的感知都是不一样的，我担心直接喂可能会烫伤夜神君的食道。"
    L "Watari said today's dish had to stay hot; everyone feels heat differently, and I was afraid feeding you directly might scald your esophagus. "

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:885
translate english food_h5_1483e059:

    # L smile3 "而且……夜神君在吃这样的料理时也更喜欢自己动手吧？"
    L smile3 "Besides…you'd rather handle this meal yourself, wouldn't you, Yagami-kun?"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:886
translate english food_h5_9c8d3e9c:

    # Y smile1 "啊啊，没想到龙崎偶尔也能体谅我呢。"
    Y smile1 "Ahah, so Ryuzaki can show me a little more sympathy sometimes. How refreshing."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:888
translate english food_h5_0ba6d447:

    # "月拿起被餐巾包裹好的餐具，抽出餐刀向下切开鲍鱼，鲍鱼滑弹的肉质顺着施力的方向一点点分开，将内里柔软的溏心质地展露在食客面前。"
    "Light unwrapped the cutlery, drew the knife, and pressed down on the abalone; its springy and smooth meat parted slowly, revealing the soft, tender core to Light's eyes."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:888
translate english food_h5_c8f14651:

    # "月将鲍鱼一分为二，从边角上切下一块沾了沾酱汁，用叉子顶住鲍鱼肉送入嘴中。"
    "Light halved the abalone with a single stroke, then trimmed a bite-sized piece, coated it in the sauce, and put it into his mouth with the fork."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:888
translate english food_h5_b6f4da16:

    # "月在咬下的瞬间便感受到了鲍鱼充盈的胶质，炖煮后的鲍汁更显鲜美，浓郁的蛋白融入到汤汁后变得粘稠，"
    "The instant Light bit down, he felt the abalone was full of collagen. The simmer sauce had only grown more umami-rich; the proteins in the sauce had thickened it into a gooey glaze."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:888
translate english food_h5_ab3230b4:

    # "海鲜豪迈的味道迅速席卷了味蕾，筋道的肉质在咀嚼时不断回弹，进一步展现出鲍鱼独特的口感。"
    "A bold, savory seafood flavor swept across his palate, while the springy meat sprang back with each chew, laying bare the abalone's unique texture."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:888
translate english food_h5_d5d18cb0_1:

    # "鲍鱼靠近中部的溏心呈现出半透明的质感，除去Q弹外还保有了些许软糯，鲜美的回味只让人食欲大开地想要吃下第二口。"
    "Near the center, the abalone's translucent core was almost jelly-like—springy yet faintly soft. Its lingering flavor left him craving another bite."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:888
translate english food_h5_abad9ca7:

    # "L在月吞下鲍鱼的溏心时开口补充了一些知识，为这段美味的餐食增添了些许乐趣。"
    "As Light swallowed the abalone's melting meat, L offered a few extra facts, lending the delicious meal a touch more interest."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:900
translate english food_h5_385675fd:

    # L "夜神君今天吃的是新宿京王广场酒店中餐厅的干鲍，订餐时主厨特别推荐了日本的两头鲍，"
    L "What you're tasting is the dried abalone from the Chinese restaurant at Shinjuku's Keio Plaza. When I ordered, the head chef specially recommended Japanese two-head abalone, "

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:900
translate english food_h5_26c45b1b:

    # L "特点就是在鲍鱼原有滑弹口感的同时能保留中心的黏度，不知道是否合夜神君的胃口呢。"
    L "whose meat stays springy, yet the centre keeps a luscious, almost sticky softness. I wonder if it suits your palate."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:903
translate english food_h5_cb6ba379:

    # L smile1 "夜神君喜欢的话，之后也可以去餐厅就餐哦。"
    L smile1 "If you like it, we can dine at the restaurant next time."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:904
translate english food_h5_caeb3db1:

    # Y smile2 "龙崎，这是约会的邀请吗？"
    Y smile2 "Ryuzaki, are you asking me on a date?"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:905
translate english food_h5_4e91d0ac:

    # L smile3 "如果夜神君表现好的话，是的。"
    L smile3 "If you behave, then yes."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:906
translate english food_h5_ca4312ba:

    # Y "那还真是多谢了，我也很想出去放放风，囚室里的空气简直让人快吐出来了。"
    Y "Well, thank you. I could really use some fresh air. The air in here almost makes me sick."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:908
translate english food_h5_1156ae05:

    # "月低下头，许久未修剪的头发遮住了他的眼睛，让L有些看不清月的表情。"
    "Light dropped his head; the uncut hair fell, concealing his eyes from L."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:908
translate english food_h5_47d5195e:

    # "月用餐刀切下了一块花菇，并舀起一口米饭放到餐勺里，和沾满鲍汁的花菇一块吃了下去。"
    "Light cut a slice of shiitake mushroom coated in abalone sauce, scooped a mouthful of rice onto the spoon, and ate them together."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:908
translate english food_h5_4195771e:

    # "餐点很快在月井然有序的分配下被一扫而空，月简单将餐具摆到瓷盘上，抬头对L说道。"
    "With each methodical bite, Light ate up all the food in moments. He set the cutlery neatly on the plate and looked up at L."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:914
translate english food_h5_c8f02e05:

    # Y smile1 "很美味的餐点，龙崎，多谢款待。"
    Y smile1 "They're delicious. Thank you, Ryuzaki."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:916
translate english food_h5_27706e41:

    # "L关闭了卡式炉的开关，整理起月用脏的餐具，在仔细清点、确保没有遗漏后重新为月戴上手铐，推着餐车离开了囚室。"
    "L clicked off the gas stove and cleared the soiled dishes. After counting them carefully to make sure nothing was left behind, he put the handcuffs back on Light and wheeled the trolley out of the room."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:916
translate english food_h5_f6665d31:

    # "在他快要合上囚室门的那一刻，原本垂着脑袋的青年突然出声叫住了他。"
    "Just as the door was about to be closed, the young man who'd been hanging his head suddenly stopped L."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:920
translate english food_h5_59c9dc7e:

    # Y pt "龙崎。"
    Y pt "Ryuzaki."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:921
translate english food_h5_416e7b13:

    # L surprise "是，夜神君，还有什么事吗？"
    L surprise "Yes, Yagami-kun?"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:922
translate english food_h5_31f02216:

    # Y smile1 "我很期待和龙崎一起去新宿的那天。"
    Y smile1 "I'm looking forward to that day in Shinjuku with you."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:923
translate english food_h5_55e77995:

    # Y "那么，明天再见。"
    Y "Then, until tomorrow."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:925
translate english food_h5_b46133e9:

    # "L有些诧异地看着月，青年倒是很快背过身去结束了对话。"
    "L looked at him, somewhat startled; the young man, however, promptly turned away and ended the conversation."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:925
translate english food_h5_982cf5f6:

    # "直到囚室的铁门关闭时冒出吱呀一声，L才意识到或许他该乘坐电梯离开了。"
    "Not until the iron door groaned shut did L realize he ought to head for the lift."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:925
translate english food_h5_053ecfd1:

    # "想和夜神君再聊几句别的。L想道。"
    "I'd like to stay and talk about something else with Yagami-kun,” L thought."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:925
translate english food_h5_27e475fe:

    # "不过，自己和夜神君还有很长的时间呢，一切都来日方长。"
    "Still, he and Yagami-kun had nothing but time; everything could wait."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:941
translate english food_p1_ce3bc870:

    # "L拿来了照烧鸡肉饭团和味增汤。"
    "L brought teriyaki chicken onigiri and miso soup."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:941
translate english food_p1_872b2305:

    # "月看见正常的食物有些诧异。"
    "Light Yagami looked surprised to see a normal meal."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:945
translate english food_p1_99c5a90a:

    # Y smile2 "L大人怎么舍得给我吃这种食物了？"
    Y smile2 "To what do I owe the pleasure, L? Finally decided to give me real food?"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:947
translate english food_p1_9b4fcd17:

    # L "……"
    L "……"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:954
translate english food_p1_6fe5c1e4:

    # L "如果觉得过于豪华了，那我就端回去了。"
    L " If it feels too much, I can take it back."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:956
translate english food_p1_429e5c05:

    # "夜神月的脸色变得更加难看了。"
    "Light's expression darkened further."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:958
translate english food_p1_9f683442:

    # Y Light "既然是L大人的恩典就不得不领情了吧，还是说你只是想用这种低级手段折磨我？"
    Y Light "Since it's your 'generosity', L, I suppose I have no choice but to accept. Or is this just another pathetic attempt to torment me?"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:963
translate english food_p1_e8dd3b2f:

    # "月的唇边有着明显的的讽笑。"
    "A sharp, mocking smile played on Light's lips."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:963
translate english food_p1_f8c602ad:

    # "L把饭团递到月的嘴边，月咬牙切齿地吃了。"
    "L held the onigiri to Light's mouth. Light gritted his teeth and ate."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:963
translate english food_p1_9f2b6fb1:

    # "L端着空的餐盘走出了囚室。"
    "L left the room with the empty tray."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:976
translate english food_p1_fa37d778:

    # L "的确算是少见的一餐呢，夜神君不需要吗。"
    L "That was an unusually decent meal. Are you refusing it, Yagami-kun?"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:978
translate english food_p1_d7a305b9:

    # Y smile2 "不，是人就需要吃饭吧，我得感谢你的人道主义呢。"
    Y smile2 "No. Even I need to eat. I should thank you for your… humanitarianism."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:980
translate english food_p1_99b2a4d0:

    # "月的唇边有着若有若无的讽笑。"
    "A faint, derisive smile lingered on Light's lips."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:980
translate english food_p1_d175de97:

    # "L把饭团递到月的嘴边，对方这次倒是配合地吃了。"
    "L held the onigiri to Light's mouth again. This time, Light cooperated and ate it without protest."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:980
translate english food_p1_9f2b6fb1_1:

    # "L端着空的餐盘走出了囚室。"
    "L walked out of the room with the empty tray."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:993
translate english food_p2_cbe32103:

    # "L端来了一份咖喱盖浇饭"
    "L returned with a plate of curry rice."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:995
translate english food_p2_98dd0268:

    # L "夜神君，饿了吗？"
    L "Yagami-kun, are you hungry?"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:997
translate english food_p2_36e2052e:

    # Y "我不想吃饭。"
    Y "I don't want to eat."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1007
translate english food_p2_c9ccbcaa:

    # L "可是夜神君距离上次进食已经间隔了6个小时了，你现在应该进食才能保证你的身体健康。"
    L "It's been six hours since your last meal. You need to eat to maintain your health."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1009
translate english food_p2_ab65e388:

    # Y jiaoji1 "我说了我现在不想吃饭！"
    Y jiaoji1 "I said I'm not hungry!"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1011
translate english food_p2_b8ce09ee:

    # L "如果夜神君改变主意了可以叫我，我随时可以收到讯息。"
    L "If you change your mind, call for me. I'll hear you."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1013
translate english food_p2_4314420a:

    # "L离开了。月依然坐在床上。"
    "L left. Light remained seated on the bed."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1013
translate english food_p2_528eff0b:

    # "到了晚上，L重新打开了月囚室的门，看见褐发青年正躺在床上，好像是睡着了。"
    "That evening, L reopened the room door to find the brunet lying on the bed, apparently asleep."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1013
translate english food_p2_84af6cdd:

    # "L拍了拍月的肩膀，青年发出一声鼻音，悠悠转醒，坐了起来。"
    "L patted Light's shoulder. The young man murmured softly, stirred awake, and sat up."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1019
translate english food_p2_369f8700:

    # L "夜神君，距离你上次进食已经过了12个小时了，如果你再不吃饭我要采取强制措施了哦。"
    L "Yagami-kun, it's been twelve hours since you last ate. If you refuse, I will be forced to take measures."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1021
translate english food_p2_5e55946e:

    # Y Light "……"
    Y Light "……"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1025
translate english food_p2_980b3c9a:

    # "L挖了一勺盖浇饭递到月的嘴边，青年这次没有反抗，沉默地吃了。"
    "L scooped a spoonful of curry and held it to Light's mouth. This time, the young man offered no resistance and ate in silence."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1027
translate english food_p2_1a8cf9a3:

    # Y "我吃饱了。"
    Y "I'm full."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1029
translate english food_p2_95adbbd1:

    # "L拿走了空碗。"
    "L took the empty bowl."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1037
translate english food_p2_d40b3fc9:

    # "L无视了月的拒绝，夜神月如果绝食会对他造成困扰，他不介意用一些强硬的手段。"
    "L ignored Light's refusal. A hunger strike from Light Yagami would be inconvenient, and L had no reservations about using force."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1037
translate english food_p2_402fdd89:

    # "他舀起一勺咖喱饭，递到月的嘴边。"
    "He scooped up a spoonful of curry and held it to Light's mouth."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1043
translate english food_p2_ece9392b:

    # L "夜神君距离上次进食已经间隔了6个小时了，你现在应该进食才能保证你的身体健康。"
    L "It's been six hours since your last meal. You need to eat to maintain your health."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1045
translate english food_p2_ab65e388_1:

    # Y jiaoji1 "我说了我现在不想吃饭！"
    Y jiaoji1 "I said I don't want to eat!"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1047
translate english food_p2_46432a95:

    # L "你自己吃下去，还是我捏住你的下颚，逼迫你吃下去？"
    L "You can eat it yourself, or I can force your jaw open and make you eat. Your choice."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1049
translate english food_p2_c96012fb:

    # "月的身体因为气愤微微颤抖着。"
    "Light's body trembled slightly with anger."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1051
translate english food_p2_81a8baa2:

    # "他沉默了几秒钟，终于选择屈服，张开嘴把咖喱饭吃了进去，味同嚼蜡。"
    "He was silent for a few seconds before finally yielding. He opened his mouth and ate the curry; it tasted like ashes."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1053
translate english food_p2_442941ca:

    # "……"
    "……"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1055
translate english food_p2_ac54dc1c:

    # Y light "我吃饱了。"
    Y light "I'm full."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1057
translate english food_p2_ee280998:

    # "L拿走了还剩下不少的饭碗。"
    "L took away the bowl, which was still half-full."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1067
translate english food_p3_57e5c8ac:

    # "L端来了牛肉盖饭。"
    "L brought beef bowl next."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1067
translate english food_p3_ecc494d7:

    # "在喂食的时候，总感觉月有些心不在焉的。不过每一勺饭都有乖顺地吃掉。"
    "During the feeding, Light seemed distracted, but he obediently ate every spoonful."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1071
translate english food_p3_72b63961:

    # L "（看来夜神君也知道绝食只会让自己受苦罢了）"
    L "(It seems Yagami-kun has realized a hunger strike is pointless.)"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1073
translate english food_p3_1a8cf9a3:

    # Y "我吃饱了。"
    Y "I'm full."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1075
translate english food_p3_95adbbd1:

    # "L拿走了空碗。"
    "L took the empty bowl."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1080
translate english food_p4_bc2a663c:

    # "L端来了豚骨拉面。"
    "L brought tonkotsu ramen."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1080
translate english food_p4_ecc494d7:

    # "在喂食的时候，总感觉月有些心不在焉的。不过每一勺饭都有乖顺地吃掉。"
    "As he fed him, L sensed Light's mind was elsewhere, yet he still consumed every bite without complaint."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1084
translate english food_p4_72b63961:

    # L "（看来夜神君也知道绝食只会让自己受苦罢了）"
    L "(It seems Yagami-kun has learned his lesson. Starving himself only leads to discomfort.)"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1086
translate english food_p4_1a8cf9a3:

    # Y "我吃饱了。"
    Y "I'm full."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1088
translate english food_p4_95adbbd1:

    # "L拿走了空碗。"
    "L took the empty bowl."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1093
translate english food_p5_58e72c20:

    # "L端来了青花鱼和炸鸡便当。"
    "L then brought a bento with grilled mackerel and fried chicken."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1093
translate english food_p5_ecc494d7:

    # "在喂食的时候，总感觉月有些心不在焉的。不过每一勺饭都有乖顺地吃掉。"
    "While feeding him, L noticed Light seemed preoccupied. Nevertheless, he ate every mouthful obediently."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1097
translate english food_p5_72b63961:

    # L "（看来夜神君也知道绝食只会让自己受苦罢了）"
    L "(Yes, Yagami-kun understands now. Resistance is futile.)"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1099
translate english food_p5_1a8cf9a3:

    # Y "我吃饱了。"
    Y "I'm full."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1101
translate english food_p5_95adbbd1:

    # "L拿走了空碗。"
    "L took the empty bento box."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1108
translate english food_j1_ca06d711:

    # "L拿来了装有简陋的炖菜和米饭的餐盘，配有一小瓶矿泉水。"
    "Finally, L brought a tray of plain stew and rice, accompanied by a small bottle of water."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1108
translate english food_j1_f421b0b5:

    # "炖菜被炖得软烂，土豆成了一团糊糊，和卷心菜搅和在一起。"
    "The stew was overcooked into a mushy sludge, the potatoes dissolved into a paste mingled with cabbage."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1108
translate english food_j1_4a50fd9a:

    # "米饭看起来像是水放少了，看着就口感发硬，团成一团。"
    "The rice looked dry—hard and clumped together."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1108
translate english food_j1_b6b8725b:

    # "夜神月看见这种饭食，眉头明显皱起。"
    "Seeing the meal, Light's brow furrowed in clear distaste."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1108
translate english food_j1_25bed7e2:

    # "餐盘被放到了地上，月仍然坐在床上，没有要进食的意思。"
    "The tray was placed on the floor. Light remained on the bed, making no move to eat."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1119
translate english food_j1_9dfa172a:

    # L "每天只有这一顿饭，夜神君最好考虑清楚再做决定。"
    L "This is your only meal today, Yagami-kun. I suggest you think carefully."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1121
translate english food_j1_eed5c6cf:

    # "夜神月没有搭理你。"
    "Light ignored L."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1121
translate english food_j1_01a3c825:

    # "L离开了囚室。"
    "L left the room."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1121
translate english food_j1_5c2548b3:

    # "后续L在监控中看见，夜神月并没有进食，只是试图喝水，但是失败了。"
    "Later, via the surveillance feed, L observed that Light had not eaten. He only tried to drink some water but couldn't."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1121
translate english food_j1_2b3d9208:

    # "饱食度无变化。"
    "Light's satiety remained unchanged."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1135
translate english food_j2_35e87132:

    # L "夜神君，到吃饭的时间了。"
    L "It's time to eat, Yagami-kun."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1137
translate english food_j2_6722d37b:

    # "L带来了全麦面包和矿泉水，他打开包装袋，拿出一片切片面包，但是床上的人仍然没有动静。"
    "L brought whole-wheat bread and mineral water. He opened the package and took out a slice, but the person on the bed remained still."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1139
translate english food_j2_8af92f38:

    # "L用空闲的另一只手扶住月的肩膀，用力让青年的脸朝向自己这边。"
    "With his free hand, L gripped Light's shoulder and firmly turned the young man's face toward him."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1141
translate english food_j2_c5461c25:

    # "月刚才似乎是正在闭目养神，被打扰之后用相当嫌恶的目光看向L。"
    "Light seemed to have been resting with his eyes closed. Disturbed, he shot L a look of pure disgust."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1143
translate english food_j2_2665a91c:

    # L "夜神君，吃饭的时间到了。"
    L "It's time to eat, Yagami-kun."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1145
translate english food_j2_ca5a4985:

    # Y angry "我没胃口。滚出去。"
    Y angry "I'm not hungry. Get out."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1151
translate english food_j2_93bdab16:

    # "L把食物带走了，在监控中看见月继续躺在床上闭目养神，一动不动。"
    "L took the food away. On the monitor, he saw Light remain lying down with his eyes closed, not moving at all."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1157
translate english food_j2_da126731:

    # "L留下了面包和水，在监控中看见月勉强吃了两片面包，然后继续躺着休息了。"
    "L left the bread and water behind. Through the camera, he watched Light reluctantly eat two slices of bread before lying back down to rest."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1164
translate english food_j2_c9dfd908:

    # "L打算强制喂食。月是他花费了不少心力才救下来的，如果因为绝食损害了健康就不值得了。\"
    "L decided to force-feed him. He had put too much effort into saving Light—it wouldn't be worth it if he ruined his health by starving himself."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1164
translate english food_j2_e0023bc8:

    # "他撕下了一块面包，把剩余的部分放回包装袋里，"
    "Ripping off a piece of bread, he put the rest away."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1164
translate english food_j2_327b8ead:

    # "然后一只手掐住月的脸颊两侧，强迫他张嘴，把面包塞了进去，"
    "Then, with one hand, he squeezed Light's cheeks, forcing his mouth open to stuff the piece inside."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1164
translate english food_j2_0e21a125:

    # "然后摁住他的下颚逼迫他合齿，同时捂住他的嘴巴防止他把面包吐出来。"
    "With his hand still in place, he pressed Light's jaw shut and covered his mouth to prevent him from spitting the bread out."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1172
translate english food_j2_f210e1e2:

    # L "夜神君既然不配合的话我只能这样做了。如果不想用这样的方式吃完五片面包，他最好还是愿意主动进食。"
    L "Since you won't cooperate, Yagami-kun, this is the only way. If you don't want to finish five slices like this, you should eat willingly."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1174
translate english food_j2_3273c556:

    # "月的目光像是要把L活剐一般。"
    "Light's glare was murderous."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1174
translate english food_j2_b2157866:

    # "但是L感受到掌下的肌肉运动，月确实在咀嚼，然后把面包咽了下去。\"
    "But L could feel movement under his palm—Light was chewing, then swallowing the bread."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1174
translate english food_j2_b6e763b4:

    # "L松开了手，重新拿起那片没吃完的面包。"
    "L released him and picked up the remaining bread."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1180
translate english food_j2_71b90b8d:

    # Y "我要喝水。面包太干了我咽不下去。"
    Y "I need water. The bread is too dry to swallow."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1190
translate english food_j2_b1ced6b3:

    # "L伸手举着水杯，月有些别扭地从他手上喝着水。"
    "Light drank awkwardly as L held the cup for him."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1190
translate english food_j2_97295d70:

    # "毕竟是别人的手，举着的时候稍有不慎水就会洒出来，打湿衣服。"
    "Having someone else hold the cup meant even a slight mishap could spill water and wet his clothes."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1190
translate english food_j2_a4976bd0:

    # "月感到有些不舒服，不过寄人篱下，他也只能忍耐。"
    "Light felt uncomfortable, but he was at L's mercy and had no choice but to endure."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1205
translate english food_j2_1488251d:

    # "为了降低月被呛到的风险，L打算用嘴喂水。"
    "To reduce the risk of choking, L decided to feed him water mouth-to-mouth."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1205
translate english food_j2_1518c05a:

    # "他先喝了一口矿泉水然后含住，月用奇怪的眼神看了L一眼，不过也没多想，如果L口渴了想喝一口水他也没有理由阻止。"
    "He took a sip of water and held it in his mouth. Light gave him a strange look but didn't think much of it—if L was thirsty, he had no right to stop him."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1211
translate english food_j2_96edcf2d:

    # "下一秒，月睁大了眼睛，因为L故技重施，又捏住他的两颊强迫他张嘴，然后……亲了上来？？"
    "The next moment, Light's eyes widened. L used the same trick again: pinching his cheeks to force his mouth open, and then… kissing him??"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1211
translate english food_j2_629d9dbc:

    # "当水流被度进来的时候他反射性地喝了半口，但是意识到这其中混杂着L的口水之后直接胃酸上涌，剩下半口水激烈地呛了出去。"
    "As the water transferred into his mouth, Light reflexively swallowed half. But when he realized it was mixed with L's saliva, his stomach turned, and he choked out the remaining half."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1211
translate english food_j2_f147296e:

    # "现在两个人的衣服都被弄脏了，上面挂着口水和一些面包渣。"
    "Both their clothes were smeared with water and crumbs."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1223
translate english food_j2_34794128:

    # Y jiaoji1 "你他妈有病是吗？！"
    Y jiaoji1 "Are you fucking insane?!"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1225
translate english food_j2_f2c83350:

    # L "我只是为了降低夜神君被呛到的风险。"
    L "I was only trying to reduce the risk of you choking, Yagami-kun."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1227
translate english food_j2_8ea16676:

    # Y "你不觉得恶心吗！！滚！！"
    Y "Isn't this disgusting?! Get out!!"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1229
translate english food_j2_0b9fd6f9:

    # "月看起来快气疯了。"
    "Light looked furious."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1229
translate english food_j2_bc9e0820:

    # "L打算暂避锋芒，现在想要继续喂食是不可能了。"
    "L decided to retreat—continuing to feed him was impossible now."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1229
translate english food_j2_5cd4b78d:

    # "他留下了面包和水，在监控中看见月勉强吃了两片面包，然后继续躺着休息了。"
    "He left the bread and water. On the monitor, he saw Light reluctantly eat two more slices before lying back down."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1241
translate english food_j3_b71222c3:

    # "L端来了一碗素乌冬面，清淡的酱油汤底里浸泡着素白的面条，点缀着零星的葱花，面条上还码着一些卷心菜丝，提供必要的纤维素。"
    "L brought a bowl of vegetarian udon. The pale noodles sat in a light soy-based broth, scattered with green onions and topped with shredded cabbage for fiber."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1241
translate english food_j3_62d07848:

    # "月沉默地吃着L用筷子夹起的面条，或许是因为饥饿，他用餐的速度要比平时快上许多。"
    "Light silently ate the noodles L picked up with chopsticks. Perhaps out of hunger, he ate faster than usual."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1241
translate english food_j3_b452c9e8:

    # "果然，面条还是要比干巴巴的食物更好入口吗？"
    "So noodles are easier to eat than dry food after all?"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1241
translate english food_j3_12292753:

    # "安静地吃完饭，月迟疑了一下，嘴唇蠕动着，似乎想要说什么。"
    "After finishing quietly, Light hesitated, his lips trembling slightly as if he wanted to say something."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1241
translate english food_j3_4b4d82eb:

    # "L停下了想要离开的动作，饶有兴致地注视着月。"
    "L, who had been about to leave, stopped and watched with interest."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1251
translate english food_j3_d8283f47:

    # Y "可以……让我喝几口汤吗？"
    Y "Can… I have some soup?"

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1253
translate english food_j3_a4a954e3:

    # "虽然月依然保持着面无表情，但是L从那张脸上读出了隐忍的屈辱感。"
    "Though Light's face remained blank, L could sense suppressed shame in his expression."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1255
translate english food_j3_0a580295:

    # L "当然可以，请用吧。"
    L "Of course. Here."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1257
translate english food_j3_01bf994b:

    # "L用勺子舀起一勺清汤，递送到月的嘴边，看着月在这时依然恪守着用餐礼仪，无声地喝下了这口汤，喉结滚动了一下，吞咽入肚。"
    "L held a spoonful of broth to Light's mouth. Even now, Light maintained his manners, drinking silently, his Adam's apple bobbing as he swallowed."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1257
translate english food_j3_0153fe2d:

    # "这种掌控感取悦了L，他非常有耐心地一勺一勺喂着闻名世界的传奇杀人犯，如同对待还不能自己进食的幼童。"
    "This control pleased L. He patiently spoon-fed the world-famous killer as if he were a small child unable to feed himself."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1257
translate english food_j3_d05678ae:

    # "月只是沉默着、沉默着汲取完所需要的水分和盐分，最后轻轻颔首示意自己已经喝不下了。"
    "Light stayed silent, quietly taking in the water and salt he needed, before nodding slightly to indicate he'd had enough."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1257
translate english food_j3_ccde8fa7:

    # "L收拾完碗筷，离开了囚室。"
    "L cleaned up the dishes and left the cell."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1270
translate english food_j4_c3808f06:

    # "L端来了一碗白米粥和一碟腌渍咸菜。"
    "L brought a bowl of plain rice porridge and a side of pickled vegetables."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1270
translate english food_j4_69d4ec0d:

    # "粥水有点稀，不过一碗全喝下去应该也能有饱腹感。"
    "The porridge was somewhat thin, but a full bowl should still be filling."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1270
translate english food_j4_b4745e92:

    # "咸菜是萝卜干，口感竟还算爽脆，月多嚼了几下才咽下去，十分珍惜这平时点餐时都不会吃完的小菜。"
    "The pickles were dried radish, surprisingly crisp. Light chewed them slowly before swallowing, savoring this side dish he wouldn't normally finish."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1276
translate english food_j4_2eb0602d:

    # L "夜神君终于学会珍惜食物了呢，我很欣慰哦。"
    L "You've finally learned to appreciate food, Yagami-kun. I'm glad."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1278
translate english food_j4_a1284554:

    # "月对L的话置若罔闻。"
    "Light ignored him."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1278
translate english food_j4_f830a205:

    # "看着月进食完毕后，L带着餐具离开了囚室。"
    "After Light finished eating, L took the dishes and left."

# game/script/daily_feed.rpy:1286
translate english food_j5_c92ea87d:

    # "L端来了梅干饭团和冰水。 月表情冷漠地就着L的手吃完了所有的饭团，喝掉了冰水。 看着月进食完毕后，L带着餐具离开了囚室。 "
    "L brought umeboshi onigiri and ice water.Light emotionlessly ate all the rice balls from L's hand and drank the water.Once he finished, L collected the dishes and left."

